    Also, the ladder set is the union of the ladder sets on all of the $M$ opinions:
    \[\mathcal{L}=\bigcup_{o\in\mathcal{O}}\mathcal{L}^o.\]","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.588240+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_005dd38b7f80a002b4c1a5dbbe4b4629d3575c67af5d77d6f4fe5dd0a28cc852","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition MartingaleReProp of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For each $x\geq 0$, the random variable 
