\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.934948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_008db285c6ab174558f64e626b93095e932dad6ec5a330fc907badf6a26b074f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 (Ordering of top-two certainty scores) of arXiv:2609.01043, 'From Truncation to Commitment:\\ Persistent Context in Uniform Discrete Diffusion'] For $q_1\ge q_2\ge0$ with $q_1+q_2>0$,
\begin{equation}
 0\le c_{\mathrm{bin}}
