{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.397594+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01321f69093b68d199d4d849fdb6df9fbe056e064c746b5a507afc85af0de0fb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainresultb 2 of arXiv:2609.04143, 'The Geometry of Real Anisotropic Bohnenblust--Hille Constants'] For every $m\ge2$ and $0\le d\le1$,
\begin{equation}
 \min_{\substack{\mathbf q\in\mathcal B_m\\ d(\mathbf q)=d}}
