{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.158282+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01a9fdc65713a6dbb87ee6c3deecaf3cf5b39dc3cdb789ab049f53f26f40523c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 (Nonempty prepared-data class) of arXiv:2609.01589, 'Uniform stability of expanding simple waves for Euler--Poisson--Boltzmann: a singular comp'] Take $n_0=n^a(t_0)$ and $u_0=u^a(t_0)$, and let $\phi_0$ be the compatible
