{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.380454+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01ea6bc2b8d9290af5651d9d4188bd68030bb1151cb833c1e46646399adf0c7b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Markloflemma 10 of arXiv:2609.03112, '2609.03112'] Let $\{\lambda_m:m\in M\}$ be represented by the rational theta data of
