where $\widetilde C_3>0$ is a constant depending on $T,\alpha, \beta, \delta$ and $\rho$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.752942+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_020cb751607281909e15c38a71d0bf4a247db8b93f9d2192ff7dd591de945a46","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2604.11682, 'Semilocalization for inhomogeneous random graphs'] Let $k \geq 1$ and $x \in \vertices$. We have the inclusion of events
