{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.733135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_020cb8f98a193459ab906f943582a1e4e6f21d97c8368064fe22374668e5660c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_LSI_quadratic_W of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] Let $T>0$ be such that
