{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.571276+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02cd619f079a9dfc5dc0cde3d140806d5ac1db539a48a83614d72ca46f75c0d8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2606.14443, 'SEMICLASSICAL LIMIT OF POLYAKOV-LIOUVILLE MEASURE and Q-Curvature Uniformization ON EVEN-D'] Let $\Theta=\frac{na_n}{\gamma}$ and $m=\frac{na_n\Lambda_\kappa}{\gamma^2}$. We have 
