{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.964372+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0301d2f75636ddd91fe641238d6c80f0951a839cb0a84dd8a7ad00b21c6aebaf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem T:L2Lim of arXiv:2412.03521, 'On ergodic properties of stochastic PDEs'] Suppose that conditions~(it:i-InvMea of the paper) and~(it:iii-InvMea of the paper) of
