{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.764187+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_031274e01cd7b5a3f3b52ff507d2fd818c17847fe53a020a068389e18f9b154e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Continuity of the half-line Robin form) of arXiv:2608.30211, '2608.30211'] Let $V\in L^\infty(\R_+)$ be real.  For $\beta\in[0,\infty)$ set
