{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.693194+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_032f1c2dd7420d3e5bb185ee81315afa6881453a46eeb257039a3b55e9981bed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thmLowerTailGnm of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Fix $b>0$ and $\eta\in [0,1)$ satisfying $b^2(1-\eta)<W(2/e)$. If $m = (1+o(1))\frac{b}{2} n^{3/2}$,  then
