{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.910576+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_03741f801d183d2d5496b7316dc6c7424d8244a764fd22f1cc019501084923d3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:cubic-Laplace of arXiv:2608.26745, 'Moderate Deviations for the Largest Eigenvalue of a Randomly Deformed Gaussian Unitary Ens'] For every $c>0$ and integer $m\ge0$, there is a constant $C_m>0$
