{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.250122+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_039f1ab4803cd99abe9833d8075ea5caf075fad449b20c445532ef196b612670","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:prob-one-iff of arXiv:2512.21026, 'Minimax Duality in Game-Theoretic Probability\thanks{Work in progress: mistakes are likely'] \everymath{\displaystyle}
  Let $(\Omega,\mathcal{Z})$ be a scalable gamble space.
