{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.353542+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_03af7c95b4bf77a0ed9c1817fe67b4e2335ad1cbebfcf0e1be13996b83ec4af1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.updet.emp of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] For $t \in [0,1]$ and $\bm{x} \in {\mathbb R}^n$, we have
