{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.596809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_04c39e98c1db5024dce5403519b7773cc34ddc6148c178e7d80f6c3f50ff9488","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn defn3.9 of arXiv:2411.09988, 'A Study in Markov Chains, Loop-Erased Random Walk and Loop Soups'] If $V = \{x_1, x_2, \ldots, x_k\} \subset A$, let
    \begin{equation}
