{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.440289+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_050f75eea0179be0341ae81eb207b0e7472a0b1c7415fb45291fa43ee476a50c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 4. prop: improved lower bound for point probability of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] For any $x \in F$, $t \geq 0$, and $\varepsilon > 0$,
