{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.422987+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_052a60963a80bc442fd7abb4906ae136b453bace4501b0e402520d890c9af1cf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary eq:minimal-m of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[corollary]{cor:moment-thresholds}
