{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.722905+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_054c4cda57ac0eeab3950e7c4c6d6ba5c631a26eeccbfcfbb58ffbf46ad99876","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (Reciprocal-$\cosh$ integrals) of arXiv:2608.06523, 'On the Gardner Transition in the Ising Pure $p$-Spin Glass II'] For every $r>0$,
