{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.994195+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0554e3d986c478c44bcf01ef34bcb12048dc4506ddf77ab357e8ff04b3c101d7","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 40 (Represented four-copy functional) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] For $q\ge2$ and $\xi=[f_n]_{\mathcal U}\in\cH_q$, define
