{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.723621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05a914163e9bf36aff727786d53f66e817de47a7f176b9444115e3721eb53e57","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:plateauInt of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assume (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper) and $Y$ be an $\R^n$-valued random variable as in Lemma~(lemma:NGcnst of the paper).  Then
