{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.239863+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05eb41fd3f875becc535586f44cdfafb1ebf64e1b84f061bc6329babeebc54be","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop prob: cover late points in a big box of arXiv:2411.16398, 'Large Deviations of Cover Time of Tori in Dimensions $d\geq 3$'] For any $\boldsymbol{F}\in \mathcal{G}_{\alpha_N, \varepsilon}$ and $x\in \mathbb{T}_N$, 
