{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.610438+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07313f066dc5e117e50ae648df631858e6c4308ba9cfed1c97958587ca5ff93e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture conj:profile of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d>8$.
