{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.828159+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0733b830c364d4173b931813098a71ff75849811312a3f9b1741eca539f3ffe9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:jump-correction of arXiv:2606.28869, '\bfseries A General Theory of Paths:\\ \large Signatures, Jump Lifts, and Expected Signatu'] For every finite-variation c\`adl\`ag{} path,
