{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.188060+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07453ba1b6f24ca14e48aa49afe7c6ac83f022b4a0de0bf635b1774be51dc14a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:shifted-conv of arXiv:2608.05262, 'The law of $(1+1)$D SOS with an area tilt in a wedge'] We say that stochastic processes 
