\end{align}
and solves the equation
\begin{align}
m_t(z)=\frac 1 \alpha \sum_{j=1}^d\frac{\alpha_j}{z-tm_t(z)-\lambda_j}, \quad z\in\mathcal D_t .
\end{align}
\item Its logarithmic potential satisfies
