{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.159493+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07c40f73e73a72772e8fad55667e41feedfbec633e904738f3c3b306415e9cb9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 21 (Identification of the Debye corrector) of arXiv:2609.01589, 'Uniform stability of expanding simple waves for Euler--Poisson--Boltzmann: a singular comp'] Assume the preparation in \cref{cor:expansion} with $M\ge1$.  Then
