{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.187913+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07e858173d19583c14477425f0bce98e19878f6e117cac677e76bfde7a7a4b0b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2606.30411, 'Notes on constants for maxima of Rademacher averages'] For every \(n\geq277\), \(p\geq2\), and \(\log(2p)<n\),
