{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.121420+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_080df8697cc9831422a875ff1bf4c494ca8b05549d32c4eb12739a00b9f0d517","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor: noex upper bound in cle singular of arXiv:2606.13147, 'Scaling limits of the single-curve interface and outermost loops in the planar random fiel'] Let $\Xi_I=\{-1,1\}^{V(\mathrm{Ball}(I))}\otimes \{-1,0,1\}^{E(\mathrm{Ball}(I))}$ be the extended-Ising configuration space on $\overline{\mathrm{Ball}(I)}.$ In addition, we  define $\Xi_I'\subset \Xi_I$ be the collection of extended-Ising configuration $\bar\eta$ on $\overline{\mathrm{Ball}(I)}$ such that there exists a configuration $\bar\sigma\in \mathtt{NoEx}$ satisfying $\bar\sigma|_{\overline{\mathrm{Ball}(I)}}=\bar\eta$. Then, we have 
