{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.615274+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_082ca20756c4ee5d2ee09e5d0730faf9700782bd386d19a745606d4e8aced527","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:boot of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d > 8$.
