{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.150361+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08308a5a75f489f33194bed688ec7bd9a068c5fede68e959c48349f435bdc7f2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 of arXiv:2604.13454, 'Invariant and periodic measures in classical spin systems on infinite lattices with highly'] Given a probability measure $\mu$ on $\ell_\rho^{2\theta}(\mathbb{Z}^+)$, the following statements are equivalent:
