{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.424751+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0865db1b69209d78f96666345e057b3b3939dc49334a298226a0f0fd8e02d441","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 158 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Let $h \in [H]$ and $k \in \llbracket k^-(h),k^+(h) \rrbracket$. We introduce
