        \mathcal E_{(lem-event-E-diamond of the paper)} = \left\{ \mathbf M_{\mathbf X_k} \leq \left( \frac{ 20\log(n) }{ \log\log(n) } \right)^{\alpha^{k}},\ 1 \leq k \leq \frac{\log\log(n)}{\log(\alpha)} \right\} \,. 
