{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.027421+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08b2e10277fb952517f40eb04ae833d01a49905e9a7b0d487b6d595f0c28dc29","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Question of arXiv:2512.06984, 'Infinite Dimensional Multifractal Analysis of the Wiener measure'] Is it true that the local order and multifractal spectrum of $W$ are independent of the choice of $p > 1$, i.e.
