{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.430648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08f07f196cc6b9486d6e6a9a94eac52953e9f9fbf45440868b4e886d64f85cac","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:FG-common-noise-criterion of arXiv:2604.22453, 'Adapted Wasserstein Barycenters of Gaussian Processes'] The following statements are equivalent:
