{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.605407+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_091ee46545c715b3a558e8f0bb4e2bad9341ba1871ef4cb0e73b83202db2a510","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:contraction of arXiv:2604.03979, 'Stationary Distributions in Monotone Markov Models: Theory and Applications'] If the conditions of (t:hp of the paper) hold, then

    \begin{equation}
        \beta(\phi P_u^n, \psi P_u^n) \leq 2(1-\epsilon)^n
