{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.304986+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0924b960b453a9634a259d5b097f6bb14bdfeded4f9387cb702b1456d01a9a08","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:dif_xi of arXiv:2411.14818, 'Scaling limits of solitons in the Box-Ball system'] For any $k \ge \ell$, $i \in \mathbb{Z}$ and $n \in {\mathbb{N}}$, we have 
