{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.598330+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0944c746d44bc3cbc1b65f35e5ad89b899abe4e3e8acfece26bb7725a3be8b5b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prp proposition2 of arXiv:2411.15724, 'Wasserstein Convergence Rates for Empirical Measures of Random Subsequence of $\{nα\}$'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem (TH1 of the paper),
