{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.076525+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_094e07612f49da9884e7ef11376a8cd770d6203fc1bb412f5990354dfa925011","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:sineb_series of arXiv:2509.15446, 'On the pair correlation function of the $\Sineb$ process'] Define $\mathbf{s}_k \in {\mathbb C}^n$ recursively as
