 \sup_{(f_{k,x})_{x \in {\rm X}_{n,k}}} \bigg| \mathbb{E} \exp \Big(-\sum_{x \in {\rm X}_{n,k}} f_{k,x} \big(h_n({\rm Q}(x;k))\big) \Big)  \\
- \exp \Big(- \tfrac{1}{\sqrt{n}} \sum_{x \in {\rm X}_{n,k}} \int_{\mathbb{R}^{{\rm Q}(k)}} \big(1-{\rm e}^{-f_{k,x}(\sigma)}\big) \nu_k({\rm d} \sigma) \Big) \bigg| = 0 \,,
