{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.881774+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_098217364c33ac957c7ec201d2f1cca3e80afa7d913488b75750e3fb6ca9d0b3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Gbranch of arXiv:2510.23430, 'On the Martin boundary for discrete TASEP'] {Yel16}}] We have
