{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.549876+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0ad2dae3e6dfe6275f9b94737f3577fee219eff0617f23034b4b30889f15ee55","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:discrete of arXiv:2603.28161, 'Boundary four-point connectivities of conformal loop ensembles'] Let $x_1<x_2<x_3<x_4$. There exist constants $C,C'\in(0,\infty)$ such that
