{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.484701+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b0144fa52c22b48016f46d1d1d65a52293eefaa85ec60ef22fdd5ed759d853f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 2 of arXiv:2608.18075, '2608.18075'] Let $\lambda_1$ denote the top Lyapunov exponent of the derivative
