{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:46:12.279698+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b904084c518db4845532b0ef532ecf0d5772fb9a6a1b4fe6100b8e4b392f8e8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 23 of arXiv:2604.22461, 'Large deviation principles for stationary solutions and invariant measures of a class of S'] For the solution $X^{\epsilon}_{t;t_0,\xi}$ of Eq. \eqref{eq: SPDE}, if the following two items hold:
