{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.009535+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0ba4164f41b1b939d86e850f4b5ac42e6f7c2d6140055e6487bb702d48886890","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21in of arXiv:2605.12777, 'Mesoscopic Rates of Convergence for Complex Wishart Matrices at the Leftmost Spectrum Edge'] [cai2025mesoscopicratesconvergencehermitian]
