{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.718826+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0bb186793ad165b1f4216f88a744403b0c98641001df2f9e48ddada51e8a6005","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 13 ({\cite[Definition 6.1) of arXiv:2511.13404, 'Asymptotic stability and mean ergodicity of Feller processes on Polish spaces'] {Villani2009}}]
