{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.752398+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0bdea1a12a6f1fcec1b06070dcae2fe31897ce352bfad1a3f478cb0aaf6116b6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 5 of arXiv:2604.11682, 'Semilocalization for inhomogeneous random graphs'] We define the strict order relation $\prec$ on the set of vertices $[N]$ as
