{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.165564+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c83321ef264ed77621ebdb533e1b2a09e69442aa3c4b05313914b3546886f9c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_UniformlyFredholm_GenericTransversality of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] Let ${\mathbf{X}}$, ${\mathbf{Y}}$, and ${\mathbf{P}}$ be second-countable tame Fréchet manifolds,
