{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.220649+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d12f16bd83e63e04d962f513ba90f8e55719ad348e62e3dd71c552acfbd618d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma2 of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] For every $q\in (0,1)$, $t\ge 0$ and $x\in \mathbb{C}\backslash\{0\}$,
