{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.353456+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d48a272558c036ea3392f7b73565a61f915c2895a2d38e3bb27397a55cab7c0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 ({\cite[Theorem 3.2, Remark 3.3) of arXiv:2606.17501, 'Critical spectral behavior and large deviations for geometric $\alpha$-stable processes'] {SikicSongVondracek2006}}]

    For any $\alpha \in (0,2]$,
