{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.475007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d71a62d6ccadf6b34c124853bd30832853e28feab3392f8862507e8b5a6d402","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:functional-remainder of arXiv:2606.21006, 'Law of the Iterated Logarithm for Weighted Sums of Functionals of Long-Memory Gaussian Seq'] For every \(T<\infty\),
