{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:04:39.795610+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d9774197b3ccab04b65791e53889bd17ba5dc127b77f91db84cac5328560097","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:tailrl-binary-recovery of arXiv:2609.02987, 'Tail Likelihood Reinforcement Learning'] If $r(x,z)\in\{0,1\}$, then
