{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.161607+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0efe9e21c447258f3afbd878fa72b22d6590e07378b526275634d65c1ccbaee8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition PropDataSingle of arXiv:2608.28949, 'The information geometry of product-reference discrete diffusion: Interaction growth compl'] For any choice of $u \in [a,b]$, the \textsf{IGC}\xspace increment is sandwiched as
