{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.885685+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f72822c9471c58357be9a14cbc0132e2ebc74c767f15b6b4bfdf342890ee323","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposizione 3 of arXiv:2506.11937, 'Random rotational invariance of integration by parts formulas within a Bismut-type approac'] Let $\tilde M$ be an open subset of $\mathbb{R}^n$ and $M=\tilde M \times \mathbb{R}_+ $. Let $ B: M \rightarrow SO(m)$
