{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:02:18.034370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f951d13846ceab966f286f79dc1a1f74896acc3f0ac2547a17f3681f668fb48","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:badRtwo of arXiv:2602.21315, 'The Instability of all Backoff Protocols\thanks{For the purpose of Open Access, the author'] Consider the setting of Definition~(def:morefromfilling of the paper) and the events of Definition~(def:fillingevents of the paper). 
 Then
