{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.581393+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_102da5fa91454f068ee97e90ec2470ef9fd76fbbc83d1f99dba82ee61b19b979","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 509 of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For any $\beta \geq\beta_0$ and $y> 0$, we have as $n\to\infty$, 
