{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:44.242634+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_10648dad3ffcc0bbe6ed73aa4570f6f970db63fd19be9fab0f19d24bbde37282","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 3 of arXiv:2604.15152, 'The Multinomial Allocation Model and the Random Box Load'] For the proportion of empty boxes $\hat q_0$, we get
