{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.555026+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_110590a0ebcee8e58aca9cd369a3975f62d33b746b825fa1db67c08ecb53b82a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Cai--Lu convex positivity) of arXiv:2609.01436, '2609.01436'] Under \cref{ass:CL}, let
