{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.130476+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1184aeb9e0dd917d05deba1f09b0677b18442ae13c6f1249a4f9c133b00a7bcd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:fdb of arXiv:2510.09818, 'On the Fourier dimension of fractional Brownian graphs'] [LL25]
