{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:55:27.258884+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_118d233c51ba58e7f75e055a90a7ff5d1d0f07fd28f0bbbd2e89a0be75a1b23b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2410.23509, 'Dynkin Games for L\'evy Processes'] Consider a L\'evy process $X$,
