{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:05:52.389292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11bdf15e0352ce54893de33efc59bd7e217a189027eebc68c2fd0986fa29c979","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition pr:coupling:1 of arXiv:2504.11107, 'An Invariance Principle for some\\% Reaction-Diffusion Equations with a Multiplicative Ran'] We can find 
