{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.068518+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11c5754c96678b86ab07df9c94d3f58b0cf7a126db3834ad23612d16cfd4aab4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition SMR_linear_prop of arXiv:2606.28575, 'Global smooth solutions by high mode Lie-Transport noise for Logarithmically Hyperdissipat'] Let $A$ as defined in (Defintition_operator of the paper) with ground space $H^{-2}_g$, i.e. \begin{align*}
