{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.314095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11f058811821ddd4f22e8749796c2d95f706d3c09b9ddcde48e79deda7156591","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 12 of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Fix $p \in (0,1)$ and $a > 0$.
