{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.890480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_120142ea29feec68f5c485aa2ad734bbc0a1efed0abac892f4ed6c2efa1bb7ee","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Teorema 29 (Lyapunov) of arXiv:2506.11937, 'Random rotational invariance of integration by parts formulas within a Bismut-type approac'] Let $\ a_{ij}:=(\sigma \sigma^T)^{ij} \in W^{1,p}_{loc}(\mathbb{R}^n) \cup C(\mathbb{R}^n)$ 
