{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.965758+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_120680bf76c1baa88c0544acde98df045be965b1ea1474ff7a867c4ea627ea61","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Camrud of arXiv:2412.03560, 'Non-asymptotic entropic bounds for non-linear kinetic Langevin sampler with second-order s'] Under Assumptions~(assu:regularity of the paper) and (assu:moments of the paper), setting $a$ as in~(equation eq:a of the paper), for all $n\in\mathbb N$ and $N\geqslant 1$,
