{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.700357+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_122300e18fc14287493892670633cd0d859d1c33d0055714e029d8369a7626cb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:volume-cancel-matched of arXiv:2411.07809, 'Pirogov--Sinai Theory Beyond Lattices'] Suppose a graph $G$ satisfying Assumption~(as:2 of the paper) has a matched
