{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.853586+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1254dc91ea657783e1d7ca2c3debdb1ea73fd17b31f0afb81cbe5f1ad7599f89","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:step1 of arXiv:2509.16694, 'A central limit theorem for two-dimensional directed polymers with critical spatial correl'] For all integers $M>0$ we have 
