{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.543451+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1276ee87dfaf4616ea4ecd7c89e0513f527c0df152293ea819418d256413c8b5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:gcan of arXiv:2603.27906, 'Marked GUE-corners process in doubly periodic dimer models'] Let $R_2>R_1>0$, then
 \begin{multline}
