{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.753588+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_12bda720fae6e74f6e1fa044416dd8e66c90bf5d412ac60a9796e321f8e0ca0b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary prop:chftempthetsdet of arXiv:2411.19192, 'Characteristic function and Esscher transform of a switching Levy model for the temperatur'] For the model described by equations ((eq:tempdyna of the paper)), ((eq:seass2 of the paper)) and ((eq:tchlevy2 of the paper))   the  characteristic function of $T_t$ under the probability $P$ is:
