 where the characteristic function of $W_t$, denoted by $\varphi_{W_t}(u)$, is given by equation ((eq:funclevy3 of the paper)) in Theorem (teo:chfintpro of the paper) applied to   $\xi^j_t=V^j_t, f(s)=u \sigma e^{-\alpha(t-s)}$ and
