{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:40:59.380809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13148774bee930c22e45ba18de0f57896a7e41fa55c1c6f0f85e4ba2fda20d56","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 14 of arXiv:2609.03962, '$L^p$ isomorphisms for the fractional Laplacian on $\mathbb{R}^n$ and their application'] Applying Hardy's inequality to $Du$ for $s-1\in(0,1)$ and the Calder\'on--Zygmund theorem, the following holds for $u\in C_{\mathrm{c}}^\infty(\R^n\setminus B_1)$:
