{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.316041+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13d7919c543ac4047a86c9af9a66f389699b2a3bf83997bb97f06d670df46610","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Orbit equivalence of arXiv:2608.30973, 'Pseudo-Anosov flow and dynamics on guts'] Let \(N_{1}\) and \(N_{2}\) be oriented compact 3-manifolds, which admit semiflows \(\varphi_{t}^{1}\) and \(\varphi_{t}^{2}\), respectively.
