{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.978420+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13d7b92f9c70954b41cd57735d3260bad2e046dc576bf67fee822b261f440288","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Exact primitive kernel) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] Let $q\ge2$ and let $k=[f_n]_{\mathcal U}\in\cH_q$.  The following
