{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.281158+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_143b963f481ae4a8179284cd006512df64b89bb0519310cf8aa1a1e5da40358d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2606.22611, 'Upper and Lower Bounds on Expected Soft Maxima\\of Gaussian Processes'] For any $\theta \in \cP_N, \bm{t}\in T^N$,
  \begin{align*}
    \lVert\hat{P}_{\bm{t}}- \theta\rVert_{\rm TV } 
    = \frac{1}{N} \min_{\bm{s}\in \cC_{N,\theta}} d_{\rm H} (\bm{t}, \bm{s}),
  \end{align*}
  where $d_{\rm H}(\bm{t},\bm{s}) \deq \sum^N_{i=1}\bm{1}_{\{t_i \neq s_i\}}$ is the Hamming distance between $\bm{t}$ and $\bm{s}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.290496+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_143d443f19dcf161314bfdf2f831f059e5261cc1e76317d0ac624399d581869a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:Birkhoff's ergodic of arXiv:2411.02030, 'Finite ergodic components for upper probabilities'] Let $(\Omega,\mathcal{F},V,T)$ be	an UPPS. Then the following three statements are equivalent:
	\begin{enumerate}
