			{\widehat Z}^n_{V, U}(A, B \mid |\mathsf{Cpts}(\Gamma)| < 2\delta_0\lVertA - B\rVert_1) \leq ce^{-v_0\beta\lVertA - B\rVert_1}{\widehat Z}^n_{V, U}(A, B)\,.
