{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.769011+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_14b7d6cbdf5bfdeec6694923772b6eeee3f91dd3ab526e1b99d630c9690ae4a6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lA4cor of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in(0,p)$
\begin{equation}\begin{aligned}
