{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.058961+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15a75013510cdc24f258912f1284f4e803ea81eb1677e2b8051d98b6a2ad7398","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:perturbed-first-order-solver of arXiv:2608.16119, 'Fully nonlinear parabolic equations under a fixed reference diffusion: weighted \texorpdfs'] Assume Assumptions~(ass:reference-diffusion of the paper) and
