\leq \ln 3 - \ln |\delta_{j+\sigma_j}| + \sul{s=0}{1} \ln(|\lambda_{j+s}^{\vsg}| + 1)  \, .$$

Moreover, $\big( M_{\bs{\sg}_{N-1}}^{\, \vsg} \big)_{ j+\sigma_j, j } \geq 0$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.923052+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15eddba57b8b446a9d6f925a4d7f69c77ef601e6035ca3a96a3cc60f33095345","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_boundtoset_zero of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, there exist constants $
