{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.200602+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_16432f3ebf4a024933173cd5b6ba5d9b343a3794f01d37350f77ae285e4ed732","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2510.23130, 'Hidden regular variation for stochastic recursions with diagonal matrices\ \thanks{E.D. wa'] Consider $\bb \xi \in [0,1)^2$ with $\phi(\bb \xi)<1$. Set $\bb \theta:=\bb \xi \bb \alpha$. Suppose that $\Psi(\bb \theta )<\8$. Then
	\begin{equation*}
