{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.754326+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1689b4e018d9c7847541d1a0f27df29ace67bd2b7e094561fab8ec9030275cf4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 30 of arXiv:2604.11682, 'Semilocalization for inhomogeneous random graphs'] Define for all $x \in \hcV^{(\rm h)}_{\nu}, \sigma\in\{\pm 1\}$,
  \begin{equation*}
