{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.817203+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_16b86d8ed052a103d501175e8933e4d096026757d389f83c8143164558116486","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem T:CLT of arXiv:2607.17113, 'Two-time spatial decorrelation for the flat KPZ fixed point'] As $N\to\infty$,
