{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:05:52.388586+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_16be1537474cf860a11af32e630fb7bb8ca8acbc7beafe24a4d77a9eebf32fbb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:oscillation of arXiv:2504.11107, 'An Invariance Principle for some\\% Reaction-Diffusion Equations with a Multiplicative Ran'] For every $a>0$ and $k\in[2\,,\infty)$,
