{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.517177+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_176ff12661a99994bf001a4b7af98d9a24321d27fa1f878be384a1df474f7727","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Wk-lemma of arXiv:2601.19145, 'Stochastic Persistence in Infinite Dimensions'] Suppose $W \in \tilde{\mathcal{D}}^{ext}_+(\mathcal{M})$ (see (spde-tilde-domain of the paper)) and $W': \mathcal{M} \to [0,\infty]$ are nonnegative functions satisfying:
