{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.284091+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_179ecf4d4f085052d8b4577dd634264964d98a403f7c8c66e3a37ee683e3c420","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:detCLT of arXiv:2604.20327, 'Persistent Homology of the Wiener Sausage II: A Central Limit Theorem for Drifted Planar B'] Let $\psi$ be a bounded Borel function supported in a compact interval
