{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.494303+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_18111a102fddaff73973d82dc3524c42f8b52afc682aed1fa30821f7d40e474e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 45 (Fa\`a di Bruno) of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] Let $g\colon\RR^N\to\RR$ and $f\colon\RR\to\RR$ be sufficiently smooth functions. 
