{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:48:24.524602+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_18b5c85b3d2882e399eafe6e794167ca6fc24cdea9907345c61af2aa5824bbb3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:separation_distance of arXiv:2512.20338, 'Up-down chains and scaling limits: \\ application to permuton- and graphon-valued diffusio'] The following identities hold: 

  \begin{equation}
