{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.226091+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1952f9f18a0f8c85fa275adc49f7683af2fd3dfe5858a7333c90d2c628a18f84","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Brezis-Wainger of arXiv:2609.00627, 'Global well-posedness of radially symmetric strong solutions to two-dimensional compressib'] For $p>2$,there exist a positive constant $C$ depending only on $p$ and $\Omega \subset \mathbb{R}^2$, such that every function $f \in W^{1,p}(\Omega)$ satisfies 
