{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.830292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_195f77dd54eb7d1a566665814d16b332119cea44bfcfa97c3b75ead0b0ad682a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:change-metric-full of arXiv:2609.00556, 'Higgs--Demailly System and Positivity of Higgs Bundles'] Let $h_1$ and $h_2$ be Hermitian metrics on $E$.  Suppose that
