{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.189788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_197aa25926195c7449209f852a47596dff4236f981d79ac67534d551504cd480","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:supermartingale of arXiv:2608.06263, 'Almost sure path localisation for the derivative martingale of branching Brownian motion'] Consider $\mathcal{Z}$ the stopping line associated with the stopping times
    \begin{equation*}
