{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:04:39.219274+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_197e0100dd6d564bd6b41e27eb2474149ad01f28bf0054a3d95ce8f3624c058a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2608.13732, '\textbf{On the First Hitting Time Problems \\ for Diffusion Processes: \\ Local Time-Space'] Assume the kernel $k(t,u)$ and the solution $\tilde f(t)$ of \eqref{VIE-1-standard1} are 
