{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.756139+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_198886d80923188ae04656e4682b7c1511e9592d2a8eb04694e051904cd0e65e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2511.04938, 'Uniform dimension theorems for parabolic SPDEs'] Choose and fix some $T>0$.
