{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:18.867637+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19c3624685191273e182ad94b3ea06b53522d5a27bff2b7a1d8e15ecbd211de6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem gamma fct reflect of arXiv:2609.02409, 'Membranes and Maps'] For all positive integers $d$ we have
