{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.589699+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19e88e850836629687d7a188343da32b5da7c1e66fe08cc31eaa12b2d8a77418","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For any $\beta\in\mathbb{R}$ such that $\beta+b>0$,  we have
