\item the Hilbert space $H^{p,q} \left( \Sigma \setminus \{a_{2g+2}\}, T^*\Sigma\otimes \mathfrak{g}  \right) $ is separable and with a countable dense family in $\Omega^1_c \left( \Sigma \setminus \{a_{2g+2}\},  \mathfrak{g}  \right) $.
\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

