{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.880461+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a6caefb3edceac73a492656fd648f6afd53395128ad47754bd76a3ad8ba54fa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2609.02065, '\textbf{From Bowditch's question to Goldman's conjecture for type-preserving representatio'] \cite[Lemma 2.9]{ryu}
