{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.809437+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1b0fb71a383e3b0f196e6897cf4fb72afc0ebf9205e75902001dc5a1408ceb8a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm l:holder-high-prob of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] For all sufficiently small $\varepsilon>0$,
