{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.316250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1b31857791b2f4e8304375bcabdfa33dbbf6e54b0e87578a7f440f04055b4c17","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:decompose of arXiv:2608.30973, 'Pseudo-Anosov flow and dynamics on guts'] Suppose that \((N,R_{+},R_{-},\gamma)\) is a sutured manifold which admits a tight semiflow \(\varphi\). Let \(S\) be a decomposition surface in \(N\) such that either
