{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.788131+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1b383032b2a490adac7e701315bc1134682e73e1ef79788300fb4e64dbca0ba6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Central Limit Theorem of arXiv:2606.09228, 'On topological indices of random caterpillar graphs'] [billingsley95]
