\end{equation}
\end {lemma}

Now, let us apply Lemma~(l:2+eps of the paper) to $X=\widetilde{\xi}_{a;n}$ and $Y=\widetilde{\xi}_{a+n;n'}$. Note that due to the upper bound~(equation eq:C-2-p of the paper) for first and $1+{\varepsilon}$-th moments, we get
\[
