\end{equation}
Now, using the $L_{2+{\varepsilon}}$--triangle inequality for $(\widetilde{\xi}_{a;n} + \widetilde{\xi}_{a+n;n'})$ and $\widetilde{R}_{a;n,n'}$, we get
