{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.589237+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1bc8152ba0d2da3d8664e6a8e379ab31175906c9e4ec305df94622fa276a3374","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm-local-Appendix of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $d \geq 1$ and $p\ge 1$.  
