{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095146+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d2fd6718ef3f027764d7bf87c1c0c232be85b955e9d52dd6f307d8ad4773c3e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem311 of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Let $p\ge 2$ and $r\ge p$ satisfy $r\le\frac{np}{(n-2)_+}$.
