{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:54:28.025662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e0536cef1e713466761be3f1cf669b5b95da6e653a8d716c269bc8c091bc656","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary lm:ds of arXiv:2608.09465, 'Balancing fractional Brownian motion'] Let $F:\mathbb R^m\to C([0,1])$ be linear and define
