{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.387682+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e49dc082d312028ebd8aeae088d4602660cf2d4804fd661878d468e87bdf1ad","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:gaussianZ of arXiv:2607.28817, 'Limiting spectral distribution for the adjacency matrix of the Watts--Strogatz random grap'] Under the additional assumption that $p_n\;\xrightarrow[n\to\infty]{}\; p\in[0,1)$, we have
