{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.678254+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e7ef5174aea066a6e4d3b505bd1a2983e79e259c8da1e976995c044dbfd96af","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn d.omegatmixing of arXiv:2605.28430, 'Limit theory for Lipschitz-localized statistics in random geometric models'] \ 
 \begin{enumerate}[wide,label=(\roman*),labelindent=0pt]
\item  The  marks $U$ of the point process $\tilde \mathcal{P}=\sum_{x \in \mathcal{P}}
