{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.429260+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e83419c8a89d3202890070c042121eb79b78262a444488eea3650408c6f6897","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 194 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] For each $q\in[m]$, $k \geq 1$ and $x\in [-\hat{W}_q,0]$, the random variables
 \begin{equation}

