{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.777910+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e8a825ec1461a68fff195c68bdb362a9bc4e99c99cd93e202b62539f8eee79e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2411.09257, 'Iterated Generalized Counting Process and its Extensions'] The distribution function  $\hat{H}(w,t)=\mathrm{Pr}\{Z(t)\le w\}$ is given by
