{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.728165+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e8baf235fe009ea739584d484e7f3eaf650872606384cb5c7c25e31aa347312","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:Gammajbounds2 of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Under the assumptions of Proposition~(prop:Gammajbounds of the paper),  
