{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.586623+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ebd6c39788f67d2a28ac7988349c762ae90a601a5c5a8a740d2a19bf6723606","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition MartingaleReProp of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For any $T\geq 0$, the random variable 
