{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.488623+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ec1a6409dd7b867c8256b39299934988fe1fde03432656011915651336840bd","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn Normalized Coulomb gas correlations for a divisor on the Riemann sphere of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] Let the divisor
$$
