{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:00:30.489915+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ee9c4aabfe1cb8b49e2c228c248461f4db3af8a05ac30183fc28982ad85320f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 21 of arXiv:2607.03924, 'Tree Coordinates and Range Martingales for Positive Operator-Valued Measures'] Let $X=\left\{ X_{w}\right\} $ be a strictly positive
