{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.504674+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f07fc0c447cda86d41026cdc6197a3764c4e2ead6f4564cc71b53480d3a8951","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 83 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] The following statements are true:
