        \text{3) $\mathbb{E}\big[\max_{1\leq i \leq c_n} X_{n,i}^2\big]$ is bounded in $n$}.
    \end{align*}
     Then $\sum_{1\leq i\leq c_n} X_{n,i} \xrightarrow{\mathcal{D}} Z$, where $Z \sim \mathcal{N}(0,C^2)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

