{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:28:08.664920+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ffbe2cd48de2e1a6cdeb0b5b09efa9875ef1fc177a3c44c0eba12994150e4f1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2607.29495, 'Fast Mixing for Low-Temperature Potts Models via Poisson Trees'] Suppose that $\rho\in (0,\tfrac{1}{20})$ and that $\mathcal{B}=\{B_v\}_{v\in \Vin(T)}$ is a rooted block decomposition of~$T$ that satisfies non-reconstruction with block decay~$\rho$ under the distribution~$\nu$. 

