{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.968831+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_200c0624da9ea73b5fea82c3d550695e02cfa2ca6f48e3ca0ff1fd5160ed6a35","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2607.13273, 'Asymptotics of transition densities for L\'evy processes with stochastic resetting'] For all $\lambda>0, t>0$, $x\in\Rd$ and Borel sets $A\subset\Rd$ we have
