{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.040534+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_20dada387dfa302d4ea118d96d1f087e844fbb4e20d8a085600be580ac3a8ac9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2606.26619, 'Ergodicity of stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on unbounded domains driven by space'] Assume that (S1)--(S3) and (H5) hold. Define
