{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:40:27.002105+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_20f85a064349a3646a5ef6afb4f15e60fc54e95a60b6ce538e942a94db4de35c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Domain of arXiv:2604.17253, 'Large Deviations for the Nonlinear Schrödinger Equation with Randomized Quasi-Periodic Ini'] Define recursively
