{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.189540+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2107b743b77316aa65f4f950cbbc8092a64b2686cd43c73bd261b9ef63f79eee","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition lem:N-third-tight of arXiv:2608.05262, 'The law of $(1+1)$D SOS with an area tilt in a wedge'] For any $\eta>0$ there exists $M_\eta<\infty$ such that 
