{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.222868+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_210a913c01a216cdb88ed1aa700a8b110381cd0aadf138abd11cb399afebf49a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 9 (Sequence-independent endpoint topology) of arXiv:2609.00501, 'Uniqueness of Finite-Time Varifold Limits for the M\"obius-Invariant Willmore Flow'] Assume the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:main} with
