{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.310063+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2200563cdf18a2bea407225b01eea84801bfd645b38a629cd0779491cfc0a6b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2609.02392, 'Large values of cubic and quartic Dirichlet $L$-functions of prime moduli'] With the notation as above, we have as $N\to\infty$,
