{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.595720+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_229b72efc1be8b1146fd7636c3f94c77e124a193584dda539c06f12b8600c71f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (One-coordinate posterior risk) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] \label[lemma]{lem:coordinate-risk}
