  Let $\{\delta_n\}_{n\geq0}$ be a non-negative sequence such that
  \begin{align}

    \delta_{i+1}\leq v_{i+1}\delta_i+z_{i+1}u_{i+1} \; , \ \ i \geq 0 \;.
  \end{align}
  Then $\delta_n=\bigo(u_n)$.","status":"unverified"}

