{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.856896+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_23144240d12d28b67a733a6075870cc5ffc559129d6326cea48a1710f894e71b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:universalityspectrum of arXiv:2510.01021, '\Large Random Matrices, Intrinsic Freeness, and Sharp Non-Asymptotic Inequalities\relatedv'] [[Tatianaetal_Universality]]
