{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:43:53.631389+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_23841701d81ddfe1aee9a21699f1f03f6c421df3668c757a4e98ac0fd7149d4e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:inter lln of arXiv:2512.17747, 'On exponentially height-penalized random trees'] Let $\mu=\mu_n$ be such that $1/\sqrt{n}\ll\mu\ll n$.
