{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.642204+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_23fa896b9e640ebb2a68b5acb77db903cf223ca2c7876e6c2300543c5e22afd8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2605.31471, 'Convergence Rates of Continuous-Time Random Walks to Time-Fractional Diffusions with Unbou'] Let $F_t$ be the Feller semigroup of \eqref{eq:SDE-flow}, and let
