{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.765381+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2417f8a942d1a8425ca8d313e0ea7e577d651c4a53642cd7b437bd8d08703172","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:lbm-first-order-splitting of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] Let $x\in\Omega_{\rm LBM}$ and let $\Lambda>0$ be a multiple eigenvalue of
