{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:25:44.973515+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_243553ba4e6b94065a39f34cb67a43edec832f12bd673fe025e2519df2b72eda","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 (Weighted beta-trapezoid) of arXiv:2605.11451, '2605.11451'] Let $1/2<\alpha<1$ and let $\delta\ge3\alpha$. Then for $0\le a<b\le1$,
