{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:13:22.527325+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2450a815f94b4529bc3d4236c306a02151bdfd6b967c8358edeec90500498d59","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.recurrence_eq of arXiv:2506.07158, 'The diffusivity of supercritical Bernoulli percolation is infinitely differentiable'] For any $F\subseteq E_d({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m)$ and $j \in \mathbb{N}$, we have
