{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.740025+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2481ae2b76a2903ed43a1bf0bd8882777872b8a152530869def339ced55e095e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 19 of arXiv:2506.10494, 'Geometric Jensen-Shannon Divergence Between Gaussian Measures On Hilbert Space'] Let $\mu = \Ncal(m,C)$, $\{\mu_k = \Ncal(m_k,C_k)\}_{k \in \Nbb} \in \Gauss(\Hcal,\mu_{*})$, 
