{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.320114+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24de5c6064844bd06901ca7b328d57ab4d149b2af66150a456bda05f866fb06d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Both $\ul{{\mathfrak S\kern-.4pt}}_\textup{gl}^\otimes$ and $\ul{{\mathfrak S\kern-.4pt}}^\otimes$ are cartesian.
