{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.454399+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2518cd52cca208c0ff8a8cf9f94e381204cfbc00903883e1d6092318d416f92e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Df eq:theta_tube of arXiv:2605.14910, 'Sharp Phase Transition for the Formation of Infinite Tubes'] Let $p\in[0,1]$.
