{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.790203+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_251b96701e6bf7ba69cbd37d0620a9b351a0ece132561ba60753a599fbade4fb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 40 of arXiv:2604.00630, 'The contact process on a bipartite spatial network'] For any~$(\gamma_1,\gamma_2) \in \mathcal S$ and~$a > 0$, we have
