{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.234026+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_253224af0dad467a36c1233a5a2fdaad73b1e57a626db8b282f0d1d78a4708df","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th01 of arXiv:2604.22510, 'Asymptotics of Multi-Scale McKean--Vlasov Diffusions with Super-Linear Kernels: a Lifted S'] Under suitable assumptions on the coefficients and initial values $\xi, \zeta$, we have
	\begin{align*}
