{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.483480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_25532320f8fd342ec51ff48ade167ad1a86bae486d4cd9cbc5370ca19bed5c75","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 43 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $\eta>0$, $\varepsilon>0$ and $b> v\vee (2\lambda)$.
