{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.195879+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2604e7873645e39cfb878ed4c455608377297d3d75001dc3b42009c92ef60dda","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma atechone of arXiv:2411.16103, 'Non-commutative Stein's Method: Applications to Free Probability and Sums of Non-commutati'] For non-commutative variables $a,r$, define 
\begin{align*}
