			+\lambda\,\exp(\lambda\alpha(z,\xi_t^{\lambda,z}))\displaystyle\int_t^{+\infty}g(r)p(r-t,z-\xi_t^{\lambda,z},\lambda(r-t))\mathrm{d}r\,\mathbb{I}_{\{t<\sigma_z^{\lambda} \}}.
