{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.199847+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_28128eff7609711ebcbd6d80ef9c41a70603b72399182fce339ac70454dc6a75","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 60 of arXiv:2510.22783, 'Universality of Cutoff for Riffle Shuffling'] As $N\to\infty$, we have $|H(\vec\bn)|\geq N^{1/2}$ and $|\partial H(\vec\bn)|\leq 2|H(\vec\bn)|^{\frac{1}{2}}$. More precisely,
