{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.644539+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_28237a6a2f15acec813012db306fe867d4349cfae9568b420891dde9800da075","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 2 (Universal lower bound) of arXiv:2607.23980, 'Sharp small-deviation inequalities for sums of independent\\nonnegative random variables'] Under the conditions of \Cref{thm:main}, it holds that
