 where $D \coloneqq  [L,3L] \times [-L,L]^{d-1} \times [5T,6T]$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:55:27.255891+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_284f34fc9cf286cf905583388de6125a6dd8c41defdf144d8a0019d70c38e6f2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:vandermonde of arXiv:2609.04092, 'Short character sums of inhomogeneous polynomials'] Let $m,n$ be positive integers and  consider the Vandermonde matrix
    \begin{align*}
