{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.608379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_28564ad78d519f3b96f33d06a9ca51f041c2bfeb67865ec52e4d7a1284f57d34","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq:regime of arXiv:2604.04747, 'Scaling limit and density conjecture for activated random walk on the complete graph'] \thlabel{thm:gumby}
