{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.600436+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_285d1062beeff50664b2e019f58926486e107db34d9cb75a1125c6f3cc4c9427","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 (Risk of the exact posterior mean) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] \label[lemma]{lem:gp-krr}
