\end{align*}
where $C_{\ref{Tenzorization}}$ is a constant.
\end{itemize} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.010265+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_28a09ccd8d0cfa7951aeac3151b1b67312609e54192cf94e121d9a39e6f10263","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] Let $\beta\in\NN^n$, put $m=d-|\beta|\ge0$, and let
