{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:07.033161+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ae2c604901b0040c6d101fd9fe83239fb67597cf78e0b894183faeca06141ca","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:ZIM_tree_monotonicity_mu of arXiv:2607.29409, 'The Zombie Infection Model'] Consider a tree $G=(V,E)$, parameters
