{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.335039+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ae5a7c6cf7d207c97e7de65cde9081064d999bbd10386a4d71a75f1175f54c4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2511.06414, 'Non-uniform Edgeworth expansions for weakly dependent random variables and their applicati'] Under Assumption \ref{GrowAssum}, 
