{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.542533+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2b17c11ce7309d889f997ee747cf273cd74c5a68afdbcdfd16312d1b7bdfa716","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary lem:action_taylor of arXiv:2603.27906, 'Marked GUE-corners process in doubly periodic dimer models'] We have that
