{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.657615+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c0f7fa13f5461008c048838dd860e4cec6d803ac27c1140159806565881c61f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma ptoinf of arXiv:2609.01885, 'The Order of the Non-universal Tree of a Hilbert Space with Respect to the Haar Basis'] Let $\mathcal F\subseteq\mathcal P([0..m-1])$ be nonempty and define $T_\mathcal{F}\in B(\ell_m^p,\ell_{b_m}^\infty)$ by 
\begin{equation*}
T_\mathcal{F}(a_0,\ldots, a_{m-1}) = \bigg(\sum_{n\in F_0} a_n, \ldots, \sum_{n\in F_{b_m}} a_n\bigg)
