{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.781309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ce13c69aeb94ce2f24a5b211cdf30edee4c6575d39e90b4cb9a23500611e604","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2603.26003, 'Pathwise Convergence of a Modular Simulation Scheme for Hybrid SDEs with Memory'] Suppose Assumptions~\ref{ass:main_construction}, \ref{ass:micro}, and \ref{ass:logHolder} hold. For any $\varepsilon_1 \in (0,\gamma)$ and fixed time horizon $T$,
