{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:48:43.580184+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2cf71dadbc2417c689a165770acd5c0d2e3429f6bec8e59d7c3c12c3c20238c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 37 of arXiv:2608.07239, 'Unified framework for asymptotically uniform iterative construction of generalised random '] Consider the quantity $\mathscr{Q}(T,U)$ from Theorem~\ref{theorem_space}.
