 P_{n,k,t,\delta}(\pc+u)=P_{n,k,t,\delta}(\pc-u),
 \qquad \pc=\frac{1-\delta}{2},
\end{equation*}
whenever both arguments belong to $[0,1-\delta]$.","status":"unverified"}

