{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:11:11.705914+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e76967f0c8c52076fd519fc788f2d6618cc7d49f51eba6973022a1930cd390b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:quotient-geom of arXiv:2609.00672, 'Deciding superellipticity and computing the Weierstrass normal form'] For $S\in\mathcal C_n$ and a point $Q$ of $S$, the subspace

