{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.334068+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e8ccf29eae28040e501ff93e6515d03aae0e981a4ece282658d2e60ee7cad1e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-prelim-gap-est-time-2-to-200 of arXiv:2607.22324, 'The conclave process'] {}
