&\hspace*{3cm}+\nu^2 \int_0^T \|(S_{\text{{\tiny $1,\!\delta,\!\nu$}}}(\tilde{z},\tilde{g}))(t)\|_{H^2(\Omega)}^2 dt \le C_5.
\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.540583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ecd8d17e4105f8f4bbc59d3f4a6efc4363acb5da9c116406c6defebe5ccfc94","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition IP-convergence2 of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] The sequence $\{x_{n}\}_{n\geq 1}$ \textit{
