{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.829027+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ee1daaf256f06eafdb349e3e7bd88705d85b45ac84e974d82e6c265000840b2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2607.19873, 'Local limit theorem for the operator norm of products of random matrices'] Let $\mu$ be a Borel probability measure on $G$. 
