{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:09:59.300988+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2f1d7fe79b812ded0873e415f91e5042b41810d2556add4c0a8edad6a494c34b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem of arXiv:2608.06500, 'Free energy of Ising models under a spectral condition'] For any $\varepsilon,t,\delta>0$, and an $\alpha$-good potential $V$,
