{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.897329+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_312dba3754faf11abfe727b7c57b441e0606fd9b33da8e07df0e64bcacef8f6b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 57 (Set Induction) of arXiv:2608.29157, 'Dilator-based analysis of $\KP$'] Let $A(x)$ be a formula and let 
