{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:51:12.738512+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_312e04ede29a851cbf322c79da8883fc85b91e3edcfe915eb24d291f41075aef","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 16 of arXiv:2605.02093, 'An analytic approach to the finite $R$-transform'] Let $\epsilon > 0$, and let $(p_N)_{N=1}^\infty$ be a sequence of polynomials with $p_N \in \calP_N((-\infty, -\epsilon])$.
   \begin{enumerate}
