{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.552764+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31ab34de6aab83302dabf7d3bbe1afaa25b592f675899b0c24ae863947259b5d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:cw_separate of arXiv:2603.28936, 'Composition of random functions and word reconstruction'] If $w,w'$ are non-isomorphic words,

