\leq C_7(b-a)^2
\end{align*}
for any $0<a<b$ and $B^{\vec{s}}=\mathcal{E}_{lk, \hat{l}, \hat{k}}^{\vec{s}}$ for any different $l, k\in \{1, 2, 3, 4\}$ and $\{\hat{l}, \hat{k}\}=\{1, 2, 3, 4\}\setminus\{l, k\}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

