			\item For all $j$, for all $\SCL_1, \SCL_2 \in \Gamma\vert_{V_j}$, we have $D(\SCL_1, \SCL_2)\le D_j(\phi_j(\SCL_1), \phi_j(\SCL_2))$.
			\item For all $j$, for all $\SCL \in \Gamma|_{V_j}, \ t \in [0, D(\SCL, \partial V_j)]$, the closu","status":"unverified"}

