{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.501164+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_328d8df8700fe258002bc0d4b4033868f63f7a1fdee49063fdcec487a98b9d26","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 36 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] The rough integral operator
