{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.250601+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3336a7a97aa853c90ea1cdad0e17115b4c56c61aff9d6457c67b2c3b0d551116","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: sub-exponential Lp norm of arXiv:2603.14163, '\LARGE \bf Tail Bounds for Queues with Abandonment: Constant, Moderate, Large Deviations, '] \textnormal{(Subexponential from MGF to $L^p$ bound) }For sub-exponential random variable $X \sim SE(\beta, \alpha)$, defined by the condition:
