{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.005947+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_33923c0711c9b9ed7ce8709cbf7be1122039c1dd92030cfa1a125b9fa73ca4b6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2606.27549, 'On Analytically Tractable Multidimensional Diffusions via Doob $h$-Transforms, with Resett'] The two-dimensional linear diffusion process $\widehat{\bf X}_t$  
