{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.808379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_344f71eae18dbd9a774ccc719c9e88ac975a58c031c7f3b0dc9d6cf0a413ab0f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm l:automorphism-action-resampled of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] Fix $B\in\mathcal{B}(\mathbb{R}^2)$ and let $\xi,\eta_B : \Xi_\mathrm{re} \to \Xi$ be the white noises defined in (equation e:def-xi-eta of the paper).
