{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:26:02.333526+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_34b607ca15745c8d3ab54211de59df6d7f78c54c5dba80a90e56cc2b81d1365c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn of arXiv:2608.30031, 'Ziggurats, taut foliations, and contact structures'] Let $M_{\mathord{\scalebox{0.45}{$\square$}}}$ be a manifold with fences and windows.
