{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.984005+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3509975c29f16662b32de4531da700d94688b090b480bf178da7021f28def4fe","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 (Finite-part asymptotics) of arXiv:2609.03339, 'Exterior Serrin Rigidity for the Homogeneous \texorpdfstring{$k$}{k}-Hessian Equation\\'] Assume $0<q\le1$ and use the normalized function $U$ from
