{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.615689+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3521d529b83ac10e10c4d284e02182bd890373274e9a60b23b314172480f4ab1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 5 of arXiv:2604.22644, '2604.22644'] For $0 < q < 1$, the probability generating function of the first hitting time $\tau_N$ is given by:
