{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:07:17.257896+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_35b367e5f59a4a9aff43941468080dc3ad1b43b94db2b0f62af98759df7268b2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition MNaseea of arXiv:2603.12774, 'Synchronization by noise for stochastic differential equations driven by fractional Browni'] We set
	\begin{align*}
		A_{1}
		&:= \overline{B(0,R+C)}, \\
