    where $C$ can be chosen uniformly in $i=1,\ldots, n$ and $n\geq 1$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.678005+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_35e194171374ed176ab724ff771f8079353f5a89028012450bc1b0fa5c6bacf8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:contour_weights of arXiv:2411.07809, 'Pirogov--Sinai Theory Beyond Lattices'] Suppose $\Lambda$ is a finite induced subgraph of $G$.  For
