{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:19:56.669471+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3646926203fd0c01b29b8abfe4e528cebc89d538b8278e7fcd77c68afe1c04cf","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 11 of arXiv:2608.30875, 'A Decomposition Theorem for Topological Semi-small Maps'] Let $X^{n}$ be an $n$-dimensional pseudomanifold with a filtration
