\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.682925+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3661ba013414eb3c525fb29669a850b09818d353f2f8f00b2fb8e996ab83503c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:optimal_renewal of arXiv:2412.00279, 'Optimal local storage policy based on stochastic intensities and its large scale behavior'] If all input processes are renewal and independent, then the optimal causal policy is, at time $t$:
