{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:52:32.340326+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_36d473d0d356598e982d90fa961b270a13eb68afcff09331e2707bf65306bf79","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Def {\cite[Sec. 10.3 of arXiv:2609.04023, 'Characterizing Contractions and Weighted Blowdowns'] {MR3495343}}]
