{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.844083+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_36f82e2991984d31eb618b3e9f2b5c597f6c6aafd8247b046831bcd0cadf90bb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary Cor: C and J of arXiv:2607.18635, 'Remainders of generalised Taylor expansions and a priori bounds for rough differential equ'] For all $\tau_0,\ldots, \tau_k\in{\mathcal T}$:
