{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.711698+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_371b4809b44864db925804342c82f52d14183dd453bbcfcfeae81fb8cb519710","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition p:skewBM RK ii of arXiv:2411.04773, 'Meeting of squared Bessel flow lines and application to the skew Brownian motion'] For any $r\ge 0$, a.s.
