{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.391663+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3754078e66edebcd26a1c6be60cd74101738fddf0aed52c6cf4a0481f2c683d1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Cov-comp of arXiv:2507.19554, 'Full extremal process in four-dimensional membrane model'] There exists a constant $C$ s.t.\ $\forall u, v \in V_N$,
