{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:14.981803+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_375d5dc4e70e38ddc1cd9d43f1028c8b3f51975ebde419ddaaab0e06f2c43a19","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 of arXiv:2607.11756, 'Full replica symmetry breaking in the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model'] Consider a pair \((u,a)\), where \(a>0\).  Begin with
