{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.299765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_376a76ab34448b02ca6ea644096a8cef11a00a82f96d4e482b308043786bd888","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:beta-power-ratio-monotone of arXiv:2608.30382, 'Convergence rates for the RMSprop optimizer with full control of the hyperparameters'] Let $\beta\in[0,1)$. The function
