{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.088749+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_380b1d89fb89f9d59ce669451dc09f173e1cb4342b05ba47bb647319fe8032a0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:compactness-fibered-probability-measures of arXiv:2606.21556, 'Mean field limit of non-exchangeable interacting diffusions on co-evolutionary networks'] The space \((\widetilde{\mathcal{P}}_{\nu}(\mathcal{X}\times [0,1]),\delta_{\text{BL},1})\) is Polish. Moreover we have:
