{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.193744+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3836bc4a23445eefa05c61d7fc95d32975c3d27bf6fd47e8d64487bb5a9ba3aa","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2510.22533, 'Marginal dynamics of probabilistic cellular automata on trees'] Suppose Condition \ref{cond:UGW} holds.
