{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.219689+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38c7693731bf8c0ab09f6045f70a6500943a6e32db0d419184ddd680741a848e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:1.10 of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] In the limit when $q$ approaches 1 whilst $k$ is fixed,
