{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.188004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3936c7eef1ffc10e8ab927d922c6e2e63bf4fc9ac440e3577fe489efcd5ccfaf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2606.30411, 'Notes on constants for maxima of Rademacher averages'] For every $2\leq n\leq276$, $p\geq2$, and $\log(2p)<n$,
