\] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.717940+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_39f36b5c555871a51f49e1fdba7789c365b725edd6f57869335c7913a81eacad","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:nupcctty of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Let $\alpha =1$,  $g$ be sufficiently small and $\vec{\textbf{a}} \in \operatorname{HB}_{\epsilon_p}$.
