	Furthermore, if $H \in C_c^2(\mathbb{R})$, the role of $\widehat{C}$ is fulfilled by some constant $C(H)$ satisfying \eqref{Cinvshift}.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.320747+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a27129148e084e2e9afbc8da58454f90d3795e1a7203de8ff3f978ca354101a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop:shadow3 of arXiv:2608.30973, 'Pseudo-Anosov flow and dynamics on guts'] Let \(l\) be a component of the frontier of \(\Theta(\widetilde{S})\) in \(P_{\varphi}\). Then,
\begin{enumerate}
