{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.226243+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b3eda04b67a267e5ff941fdbefdc64de29f823e3eedd8009739131fc449aa2b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Poincare-in of arXiv:2609.00627, 'Global well-posedness of radially symmetric strong solutions to two-dimensional compressib'] Let $\Omega$ be a bounded Lipschitz domain. If $\boldsymbol{v}\in H^1(\Omega)$ and $\rho$ is a non-negative function such that
