{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:35:04.164877+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3cb27d094f7a64bcdbeafac8942afa6385cb005951e7855e44a40db4094e6520","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 53 of arXiv:2608.30059, 'Multihomogeneous Measures and Stochastic Polar Representations'] If \(\nu\in M_{\chi,\sigma}(E)\) and  
