    we have that for all $j \in \N, n \in \{0,1,2\}$, and $1 \leq p<\infty$,
     \begin{equation*}
         \|\nabla^n u^j\|_{L^p_\omega \continuous^0_{t,x}} \leq K p^\lambda 2^{(n-\alpha)j}.
