         \item for all $p \geq 1$, $M \in L^p_\omega L^p_y$,
         \item and for any $y,z \in \T^d$ and $w \in C^{1/2 + \delta}([0,1])$ with $w_0=0$, if we have any solution $X$ to~\eqref{eq:main refreshing ODE 0}, and any solution $\tilde X$ to 
