{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:20:07.914787+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e3013575858d77a425927fd7f4f969e611ca8c5090895535e42a00d4545cc99","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem_parity of arXiv:2608.29914, 'Fixed points in abstract provability structures'] Let $S$ be an APS and suppose that $\boxtimes\top\leq\bot$.
