{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.023222+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ec9b79c071e8898fe7e34aaedfe2ffca97e03f80a90b6bcce6e2dda9f7805b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Pro 4 (\protect{\cite[Theorem 1.2) of arXiv:2609.02879, 'On the cut locus of Hamilton--Jacobi equations I: structure and propagation via the touchi'] {Azagra2023}}]
	Let $\Omega \subset \R^n$ be an open and convex set, and let $\phi \in \operatorname{SCL}(\Omega)$.
