    \mathbb{E}\bigg[\prod_{i=1}^s \mathrm{Tr} \Big(\prod_{j=1}^{k_i} U_{n_{i,j}}\big(\frac{X}{2}\big)\Big)\bigg]
    =  \mathbb{E}\bigg[\prod_{i=1}^s \mathrm{Tr} \Big(\prod_{j=1}^{k_i} U_{n_{i,j}}\big(\frac{\widetilde{X}}{2}\big)\Big)\bigg] + o\big((Nb_n)^{\sum_{i=1}^sk_i}\big).
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

