{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:19.041060+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ff8c77ca7d611ae3c298e062623688ce42724783d6cd79e06f841d1d36646f1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-C-2 of arXiv:2609.02552, 'Resolvent Estimates for the Stokes Operator \\ in a Three-Dimensional Lipschitz Domain'] Let $\Omega$ be a bounded Lipschitz  domain in $\mathbb{R}^3$.
