{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.774206+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_404ef4246171a5b0d666fca43c54334d05cc70b474f0f5748ce3a3cd156aae26","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma long-range-percolation-coupling of arXiv:2608.00399, 'The Heavy-tailed Frog Model'] Let $d\ge1$, $\alpha \in (0, d)$, and $Q \in \mathcal{H}_{\alpha, K}$. 
