{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.719131+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40c72336a62f8cfba674c296b8d7807fdda0d85b4eb632266e4a19c1bcc5ef72","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 of arXiv:2511.13404, 'Asymptotic stability and mean ergodicity of Feller processes on Polish spaces'] Let $\mathfrak{F}_d$ satisfy $\{f\in L_b(\X):\|f\|_{\infty}\le r\}\subset\mathfrak{F}_d$ for some $r>0$. Then the following three statements are equivalent.
