{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.249948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40d820dd2c239ad5f6c00d472cd6883ad5e852be968ab1c97b6bf0dd3ca66153","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:basic-facts-probability of arXiv:2512.21026, 'Minimax Duality in Game-Theoretic Probability\thanks{Work in progress: mistakes are likely'] Let $(\Omega,\mathcal{Z})$ be a gamble space, and let $A\subseteq\Omega$.
