 Z=\frac{\prod_{\chi} (\chi+p)^{\binom{m(\chi)+1}{2}}\prod_{\substack {i<j:\\ \chi_i>\chi_j}}(\chi_i-\chi_j) }{\prod_{i=1}^k\chi_i^{k-i+1}},\qquad \Phi^{\varnothing, \mathcal B}(z)=\prod_{i=1}^k\left(1+\frac{\beta_i-p}{1-p}(z-1)\right)  .
