{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.735411+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41564fa68d338e22531e2a675f6ea6932380eeb8eeabb5c004c7aef271b33e13","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm 12 of arXiv:2506.10213, 'Coupling of forward-backward stochastic differential equations on the Wiener space, and ap'] Suppose that $\mu$ in \eqref{fbsde:equ:general}
    satisfies Assumption \ref{coefficient:assume:general}, Assumption \ref{fbsde:basic:assume:p:general},
