{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.246763+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_416a6d06ce8f8e241ec5449e4e3d9974ec496ae1ffde2d3c3ed1083541f1d406","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem main of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp Suppose that in addition to Assumptions (assump:potential of the paper) and (assump:noneq of the paper), the following assumptions are satisfied.

\begin{enumerate}
