{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.591837+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41718cdef25e80717658e119dfe7a99cd2ad1f72a5e2207998f1b6f517b422b2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma MMD-A-H of arXiv:2608.30582, 'The flexible part of intermittent Onsager theorem for the two-dimensional stochastic incom'] Let ${\varsigma _l}$ be the symmetric mollifier with the scale $l > 0$. Then
