{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.005863+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_417596aabb523492c663eab1a50f50a366b7ccc9cf45aaa8fbc3502a1ccb903d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_w_dim2 of arXiv:2606.27549, 'On Analytically Tractable Multidimensional Diffusions via Doob $h$-Transforms, with Resett'] Let the assumptions of Lemma (pos_eigenvalue of the paper) hold, and let the vector ${\bf r}=(r_1,r_2)$ satisfy 

