{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:07:17.279151+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41b9bafdc41193cf4c38bd85cf237c8112fe77d55aaefb0c2f5bca7bbb1c46d5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop eq:taum of arXiv:2603.21634, 'Individual-based stochastic model with unbounded growth, birth and death rates: a tightnes'] Under the \hyperlink{gen}{general setting}, we almost surely have
