{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.807553+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42fd7d86d3c28d70afbd7bf3569dc7a3c6a141e145933706972ea82a49781c08","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 77 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Let $u \in \rU$ be arbitrary but fixed. We define a function  $\varphi^u: [0,\infty) \times V \to \mathbb{C}$ by  
