{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.322714+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4306dcff566aaec7a96b1bc25eb1de63d3107ce06eef4e11d4aaed43b9108ee9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 (Endpoint estimates in the low-parameter rectangle) of arXiv:2608.30304, '2608.30304'] Let $n\ge1$ and $\alpha,\beta\in[-\tfrac12,A_0]$. If
