{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.704641+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_430d4373940fb00d36ab6e4f2e1ca32595e647b75d394617fcd33523557b4701","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2609.02711, 'Differentiability of the Leading Lyapunov Exponent \\ of a linear differential equation wi'] Let $f:\R_+\to \R_+$ measurable such that for some $\ee>0$, the
