{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.612588+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4312ffa10ed6df686a82f75976c0332dee04c4b97432c08f322e597786c81229","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 41 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] There exists a coupling of $\tl k^{(n)}_{\beta,2a_n}$ and $k_{\beta,2a_n}$ such that for $n$ large enough, for any fixed $0<\alpha<1$, we have 
