{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.221114+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_43c175d5bb426e9ed3de3abcf2cf3c701162a3d7e6667f085789144eb0963a25","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] For every $q\in (0,1)$ and $k\ge 0$
