{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:40:27.002832+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44d725555d8c9583dba76a0455ee5c441d1f44b5f23c82fa7cf5d5efb88c22b0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition lemma:cif of arXiv:2604.17253, 'Large Deviations for the Nonlinear Schrödinger Equation with Randomized Quasi-Periodic Ini'] For all $k\geq1$, the following estimates hold: 

