{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:29:14.934956+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44ee517ef53a81ad13565731138647305969cd3c887556651fca98f15f30c888","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop.L2FluxDeg2 of arXiv:2606.13442, 'Scaling limit of additive functionals for reversible non-gradient exclusion process: criti'] The following $L^2$ and flux estimates hold for the two-scale expansion $\widetilde{G}_\lambda$:
