{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.718090+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44ef547e8575f6e0fbd19a2067aabc37e418de62894cb0b50d6ccd625907676e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2609.01166, 'Nonparametric inference for density-dependent McKean--Vlasov diffusions'] For every candidate $\xi$, and \(M>v_\star\),
