\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:48:17.116976+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4599365147536ca0367fcc01a3a5c3ec705f21f59e46e20506b335b242b6cacb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 145 of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] Fix $h>0$ and a base point ${\hat x}_0\ge 0$. Let ${\hat x}_1={\hat x}_1^{[M]}$ be chosen so that
