{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.370023+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45a67d95ac152cb3e80326093496bda2dc0eec6aec54d71fd81cf8000ad83814","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:spi of arXiv:2411.13430, 'Optimal subelliptic super-Poincar\'e and isoperimetric inequalities on stratified Lie grou'] Under the assumptions of Theorem (thm1 of the paper), the measure $\mu$ satisfies the $q$-super-Poincar\'e inequality 
