{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.413075+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45a825e262565fadcb75118fe126b1e7e9f1b881aa1e17737de8fbac79a96198","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq:DPalm1 of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For all non-negative measurable functions $f$ on $(\Omega,{\mathcal F })$,
