{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.795833+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45e3f2cd190946e0f821fffc5c91bf58cd50e012d41757b074fe2915d9a53685","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L_rho_comb of arXiv:2605.15066, 'The critical activation density in graph bootstrap percolation'] Let $A\subset B\subset C$. Then, for any $\alpha>0$, 
