{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.538346+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45eb6952fa8c21a1bcf7740894a8323c133202060fd93cf1ccb886d71b1779e3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2608.25829, 'Topology of low-dimensional generalized Ricci solitons and string backgrounds'] The following hold:
