{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.350639+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_46a9456bd6230ed97e4940746bec7b073f4dbd888ffd37c3ecfc805c437f52e2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] For $p > 0.391$, we have
