{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.782698+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_46bd7a3c6f017ed0f882da0b77163214d5335d172e5670380af742ec76dc8fa0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2411.09257, 'Iterated Generalized Counting Process and its Extensions'] For $|u|\le1$, the pgf $\hat{G}^q(u,t)$ of $q$-iterated GCP is given by
