{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.057954+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_46e1c01735e103fe9aff65abd510ee6aac9e76b00ba26e8d11b85fb30570a4e8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:brownian-calibration of arXiv:2608.16119, 'Fully nonlinear parabolic equations under a fixed reference diffusion: weighted \texorpdfs'] For every $\alpha\geq0$,
