{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.188536+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_472c4f87412350e9c1e5a8be960afbb67d73fbb68a27293e3063bfe5069ead91","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 152 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Assume that $a,b$ are smooth and bounded and let
