{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.761187+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_475202024a1e30f435f48213f87ab20735829421dff81b8f94372a71eaa1a74a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop unc of arXiv:2609.02682, 'LDP for tensor forms'] Under the assumption of (c2-1 of the paper), suppose $\alpha_1\ge 0$ and $\alpha_2=0$. 

