{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.728888+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4797795094c052764f07f0b06e9c2d7c27648803c8446dbe3068d26ae4df4016","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-product-estimate of arXiv:2411.04500, '\LARGE Probabilistic Approaches to The Energy Equality in Forced Surface Quasi-Geostrophic'] [Res95]
