{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.498579+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_47b472497d7615dd0b1375125a86300ea4fc3daaae47c904997d8a9fc3c5ca31","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2605.09706, 'A dyadic construction of a three-dimensional attractive point interaction Markov family'] Fix $T,\beta>0$ and $x\in\R^3\setminus\{0\}$. For every $L>0$ and
