{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.664968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_486dfd025f385aa60fb0ce7eae065c8b72006cddfe7e3fab027a96f3068c600b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop var-lb of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] Assume $n/\ell\to\infty$ and $\go_e\stackrel{\mathrm{d}}{=}\mathrm{Exp}(1)^{1/\theta}$. 
