{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.760749+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_493e197c55425b901165b9fb8c37244bb60d4426ae00997d042f6a6fd13c3469","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2604.12233, 'An upper bound on the smallest singular value of dense random combinatorial matrices'] Fix $b>0$ and $\gamma\in (0,1)$. Let $d\leq n$ be positive integers. 
