{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:04:39.206905+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_493e500c935b41e58a9d2d30decb39ceaab49ef3490e6aad2ff46fc1c76b6b88","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Meta-theorem: coarse MLSI \(\Rightarrow\) asymptotic completeness of free-energy dissipation) of arXiv:2608.13677, 'Asymptotically complete free-energy dissipation: \\ a coarse MLSI holds at any positive te'] \label[theorem]{theorem:intro_free_energy_dissipation_from_MLSI}
