{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:59:45.465474+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_496e9371e88b30edd38cae01ce5bb35e8e9dce5584a071c1939b65ba962ffdb9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_initial of arXiv:2411.16572, 'Optimal decay of eigenvector overlap for non-Hermitian random matrices'] Fix small constants $\epsilon,\tau>0$. The following hold
	\begin{align}
		&\Big| \big(G^{z_1}(\mathrm{i} \eta_1) A_1 G^{z_2}(\mathrm{i} \eta_2)-M_{12}^{A_1}\big)_{{\bm x} {\bm y}}\Big| \prec \frac{\sqrt{\rho^*}}{\sqrt{n} \eta_*^{3/2}}, \\
