{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.249771+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_49c0e02b9b0307347fca3fafa087ba78110683e7f193254380602613c7db6c62","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:basic-facts-homogeneity of arXiv:2512.21026, 'Minimax Duality in Game-Theoretic Probability\thanks{Work in progress: mistakes are likely'] Let gamble space $(\Omega,\mathcal{Z})$ and variable $X:\Omega\to\overline{\mathbb{R}}$ be given.
