{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.461196+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_49cb8ecbc3cf0eb4e6bad5c6f6ffa022e3aa1e11c1f8599cdd970d2bf5936d45","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 58 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $\mathcal{Z}$ be a solution to the intermediate martingale problem in Definition~\ref{defSPDEfberel}  
