{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:17.375445+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a0cc6595b2e031ffe3c3609b1cc73e729aaad4fa899bed85a9214418abedb79","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 11 of arXiv:2606.04636, 'A Thomson-type variational principle for diffusion coefficients'] Let $V_{l}$ be the space of admissible flows $\phi\in\cH_{2}$ such
