{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.735810+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a135c2150de95d107b83c0934e57dda209d5b4a8de603b9449331a1be069b0b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 16 of arXiv:2506.10213, 'Coupling of forward-backward stochastic differential equations on the Wiener space, and ap'] Assume the FBSDE \eqref{fbsde:equ} satisfies one of the conditions:
    \begin{itemize}
