{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.326926+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a602bc46101e09197c1f9d7d321126f32389bb992676894febfa3afc861d317","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma restr-gl-sp-right-Quillen of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $\alpha\colon G\to G'$ be a homomorphism of compact Lie groups. Then
