{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.316964+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a63f5123ded1363a00cc5a5f43753578170d4a04506dde5f4b82fc6e840372c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem wlln of arXiv:2604.12815, 'On ergodicity of the SAGA-LD algorithm\thanks{The author gratefully acknowledges the suppo'] Let $W_{n}$, $n\in\mathbb{N}$ be a real-valued process with $\alpha_{W}(n)\to 0$, 
