{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.749784+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4b95bd7db4f8425136c81a338d58914d47225aed21cd75da17cdd5c38ee3fb75","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2608.29872, 'Local Laws and Outlier Eigenvalues for Spiked Separable Covariance Matrices'] We have the following estimates.
\begin{enumerate}
