Overloading notation, we also lift $f$ to a map $\text{$\mathbf{f}$}:\text{${\mcb{C}}$}[\underline{\tau}]\rightarrow \text{${\mcb{C}}$}[\underline{\sigma}]$ by setting $$\text{$\mathbf{f}$}F() \eqdef \hat f \circ F\big( 
