{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.989900+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4c559784304574a908b1f62de9abdc169d67e1f3a97cc44d7192a42e816a44d1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] There exist constants 

