{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.654221+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4caa48b5ce52ddc4dd0a40865196cb96a89044805e16ff65af4de45dbaeac8a8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 3 of arXiv:2609.03713, 'A Sharp Mass Threshold for Boundedness in a Critical Quasilinear Chemotaxis Model with Ind'] There is a critical mass $M_c>0$ (defined in~\eqref{Mc} below) such that the following hold:
