{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.625880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d0f21d8c9c4ab3b70792f21c05fc23fced556469729cbf2449669d2a32a94bf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop of arXiv:2411.09988, 'A Study in Markov Chains, Loop-Erased Random Walk and Loop Soups'] The following gives a way to sample the loops $\ell_0, \ldots, \ell_{k-1}$ given $\eta$.
