{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.147375+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d146d24704afb358a600490d61d18ab4e06357111b55d843ef48cfaa87a9d47","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (Uniform Gamma small-ball bound) of arXiv:2604.13149, 'The Distributional Tail of Worst--Case Quickselect'] For every integer \(m \ge 1\) and every \(x \in [0,1]\),
