{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:32:35.568087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d55505db69418ef4798c96b2afa0e9c232295822103918bccff213f922078b1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.block-moment-bounds of arXiv:2605.26082, 'Quantitative Einstein relation for reversible diffusions in a random environment'] Let
