{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.098980+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e06e595e173cbf0a5515304ae19b5b816b33533b45e83a5f05a52fe12bd594c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2601.20502, 'Optimal matching under size priority'] The subspace $\mathcal{L}_{U,\mathcal{M}}(\mathcal{G}^{\star}) \subseteq \mathcal{L}_{U}(\mathcal{G}^{\star})$ is defined as the set of 
