{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.592671+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e1a43d5bb78f761a4fe647b5206a4ffaaf932623deee969a802fbda024f9660","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem1 of arXiv:2608.30592, 'Infinite Matrix Operators and $E$-Frames in Hilbert Spaces'] Suppose that $E$ is invertible and $\Psi=\lbrace \psi_k\rbrace_{k=1}^{\infty}$ is a sequence in $\mathcal{H}$. Then
