{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.163300+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e9326c726b1dccd23717ff127bafd18162b1a882da4ad82229ebf208e636ad0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 13 of arXiv:2607.02489, '2607.02489'] Let $\AS\colon\HS\to2^{\HS}$ be a maximally monotone operator such
that $\zer\AS\neq\emp$, let $(\upgamma_{\nS})_{\nnn}$ be a sequence
in $\RPP$ such that $\sum_{\nnn}\upgamma_{\nS}^2=\pinf$, 
let $(e_{\nS})_{\nnn}$ be a sequence in 
$L^2(\upOmega,\FE,\PP;\HS)$, and let
$x_0\in L^2(\upOmega,\FE,\PP;\HS)$. Iterate
\begin{equation}

\begin{array}{l}
\textup{for}\;\nS=0,1,\ldots\\
\left\lfloor
\begin{array}{l}
x_{\nS+1}=\mathsf{J}_{\upgamma_{\nS}\AS}^{}x_{\nS}+e_{\nS}.
\end{array}
\right.\\
\end{array}
\end{equation} 
Set $(\forall\nnn)$ 
$\uptheta_{\nS}=\sum_{\kS=0}^{\nS}\upgamma_{\kS}^2$. 
Then the following hold:
 \begin{enumerate}
\item

Suppose that 
$\sum_{\nnn}\sqrt{\EC{\norm{e_{\nS}}^2}{\FE_{\nS}}}<\pinf\;\Pas$
and $\sum_{\nnn}\upgamma_{\nS+1}^{-2}\uptheta_{\nS}
\EC{\norm{e_{\nS}}^2}{\FE_{\nS}}<\pinf\;\Pas$ Then
$\norm{\moyo{\AS}{\upgamma_{\nS+1}}x_{\nS+1}}
=\mathrm{o}(1/\sqrt{\uptheta_{\nS}})\;\Pas$
\item

Suppose that $\sum_{\nnn}\sqrt{\EE\norm{e_{\nS}}^2}<\pinf$ and
$\sum_{\nnn}\upgamma_{\nS+1}^{-2}\uptheta_{\nS}
\EE\norm{e_{\nS}}^2<\pinf$. Then
$\norm{\moyo{\AS}{\upgamma_{\nS}}x_{\nS}}
=\mathrm{o}(1/\sqrt{\uptheta_{\nS}})\;\Pas$ and
$\EE\norm{\moyo{\AS}{\upgamma_{\nS}}x_{\nS}}
=\mathrm{o}(1/\sqrt{\uptheta_{\nS}})$.
\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.558322+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e9340ca1923afab2ea2406e5adea27b75542e10db12e31e1ddc8338f2e8a693","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Summability of \(\Theta_j(h)\)) of arXiv:2609.01436, '2609.01436'] For every fixed $h>0$,
