{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.117411+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e96fed0843c45d4d535a4eb218bb6354658d6c4d797745c7ca9bef1bf95f67e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:antisym-sob of arXiv:2608.17022, 'Sharp hypocoercive convergence estimates for underdamped Langevin dynamics with specular r'] Let $f\in\mathscr C$ and let
