{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.490308+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ea46b589eeb7feac8db36157d87d928f67de4305bd8eaa9fd26874ae3035f81","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] The homogeneity defined in \eqref{e_def_homo} has the following properties: 
