{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.943948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4fcd9336ba366329b39ec1279aa9867d8769692bab94ac36f5e69d5d45f5b1cc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:upper of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] For any $\omega\in \text{AF}(\Lambda,R,b)$, 
