{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.429411+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50564ed8fa3f855a7307ca584c773bf41480549249cc71dfd62b223924f90353","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 195 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] The \emph{even} Green function is defined for any two points $p_1,p_2 \in \Sigma^{\textnormal{half}}$
