{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.154474+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5059a846da129dc652c222753252c0fa9efefbf2e431846440036baee759a0e4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2604.13819, 'Convolution, cumulants and infinitesimal generators in the formal power series ring'] If $\{Q_s\}_{s\ge 0} \subset  \mathcal{A}_{r}^{(t)}$ satisfies that 
