{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.148426+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50c20bdf8f2a67b7fd6cb109028299709a24ad18469126ca7db4c41ab8e6102d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Jordan2_lower_tail of arXiv:2606.24465, 'History estimation in random recursive trees:\\Pointwise approach via iterated Jordan cent'] For the Jordan-$2$ ordering $\widehat{\sigma}_2$, there exists a positive constant $C$ such that for any $n\geq 1$, any vertex $v \in[n/4]$ and any $S\geq 1$, 

