    for all $n$ large enough.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.726859+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50c71cd7c68c703f9f198eb93056289a93706a5d8aef6b456d2ba47434effb12","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] Fix \(0<a<R<\infty\) and \(r\in(0,a)\).  There is
