{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.683528+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50d0eee8a22ce9e2dda6980d76f8b1462b397464d344a01bfa9f79ee86453256","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 18 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] Let $j\in\ZZ_{>0}$ and $k,k_1,k_2\geq3$. For $\tau\in C$ and $\lambda\in\latzero$, we have
