{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.522726+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_511304e551af087d6b8e4722376129bf72fa09ccea8a177c0b3143a6ce16dae2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm EE of arXiv:2411.03104, '{\bf Coupling Methods and Applications on Path Dependent McKean-Vlasov SDEs}\footnote{Supp'] Assume {\bf (B)} with
