{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:28:08.697261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_51bd9887994052709b1303cc044edf8bd2d4426c4634977c4a1facbe4e145757","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 8 (Wasserstein characterization of substitution-MASD) of arXiv:2607.29560, 'Tractable Relaxations of Multivariate Stochastic Dominance via Optimal Transport and CVaR'] For every $0<\gamma\le1$,
