{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:41:03.289196+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_521c50953c3d52814f673d03c94f01d408fbca1d45a17068496070e1c0ec7a30","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem harmonic of arXiv:2411.08796, 'Optimal stopping for Markov processes \\ with positive jumps'] For any Borel set $B$, the Green kernel satisfies;
