{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.580116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52289900b2a457c3d56a9f6784b0d8b7f3a067187fd6aef1d8d444c7f2fb7d19","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $k\in \Nbb_{\leq n}$, $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$, and $1\leq q\leq p\leq 2$,
