{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:30:07.876634+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5287a112a5e2d2552cdd250a54a7bae25e5e29e64ff8d1e920175625f697dc6d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_not_too_dense of arXiv:2608.09105, 'Longest convex chains with i.i.d.\ points'] Assume (equation p_upper of the paper) and (equation p_lower of the paper).
