{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.251599+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52d35af44ecb9f274d351179e356ecc5cee229a97fdd08af4e90d5cbc15d1952","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 65 of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] Let $K,  D $ satisfy \eqref{eq:costanti}. 
	Let $0<q\le \varepsilon_0$, 
