{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.490409+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52efa052c67010dd4952940b093cad4d2893548dfb19e5c6a4c011b6c3dad904","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 18 of arXiv:2509.09589, 'Geometry of critical discrete structures: long-range percolation on the hierarchical latti'] [Lower bound]
