{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.599800+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52f41ff7f322402f761295517216cc1dbdce7a18b41f4586524fae6eb26b1e41","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:suff of arXiv:2412.03450, 'On intermediate levels of nested occupancy scheme in random environment generated by stick'] Assume that there exist constants $a_1, a_2>0$ and $r\in (\alpha, 1]$ such that, for all $v\in\mathbb{R}$ satisfying $|v|\leq a_1$,
\begin{equation}
|\mathbb{E} {\rm e}^{{\rm i}v\xi}-\Phi_\alpha(v)|\leq a_2 |v|^r.
