{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:36:49.844370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_539553cc3a21c3354baae4d3f4f4251b1991507fdd237f5dbd9ce5b2bd472d43","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:dgt4-linearization of arXiv:2609.02829, 'Quantitative explosion and percolation of the divisible sandpile'] Fix $T>0$ and let $n_R\coloneqq\lfloor R^2T\rfloor$. For every
