{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.847576+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_539c9798250a2f68193836322a3f6ada17b5eddcb21d6f7c15fa1028499c7f18","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 48 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] For a normed space $E$ the following conditions are equivalent:
