{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.116780+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_53b08e0078ba7cbb9574cc655260f8f07841c2a6fa9ab64d5094897292e5c536","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: adding external field in sle continuity of arXiv:2606.13147, 'Scaling limits of the single-curve interface and outermost loops in the planar random fiel'] Let $\mathcal{F}_i$ be the
