{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.498757+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_53bb26465646523fbb9849e5d5580b6b6d60a762bacb46d173537b627577a308","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma M of arXiv:2607.05418, 'On the Group Randomness of 0-1 Real Sequences from Binary Linear Codes'] Assume $d^\bot \geq 5$. Then for all fixed positive integer $\ell$,
