{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:15:08.982616+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_544c166ceac027d17464bd37670d72b0f191e4503067dca72c671bda5c1cbc94","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:opdam of arXiv:2411.10829, 'Airy$_\beta$ line ensemble and its Laplace transform'] For each $k,N=1,2,\dots,$ and each $\lambda_1\ge \lambda_2 \ge \dots \ge \lambda_N$, we have
