{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.658550+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_54ec7e76ba53673ea722f7393c91d72f4c54aef3db0b7f0d3a21f2fd15564844","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Co ratio of arXiv:2604.07183, 'Stopping on the last success with unknown odds: asymptotic minimax optimality of the plug-'] Fix~$p_0\in(0,\frac12)$ and~$a\in(0,1)$. Then,
\begin{equation}
