{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.803213+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5572b8ca64e5cfe44f6583b09fbc57511d71ac0bf2db47abc051c18634c82d83","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p:half-strip-ES of arXiv:2607.18194, 'Temperature chaos in directed polymers'] Let $\gamma\in(0,\frac{1}{6})$ be the parameter fixed at the beginning of (s:discrete-LPP-proxy of the paper).
