{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.381039+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55aa06b8ff810c70f359c9422879b1b1d5566e49d85ea8d69bd184d3fcbfd328","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:ergodic via independece of core of arXiv:2411.02030, 'Finite ergodic components for upper probabilities'] Let $(\Omega,\mathcal{F},V,T)$ be an UPPS. Then the following statements are equivalent:
