{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.344706+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55b2c67944fbf2845c120fce27e7b09ed2034785dc158231d49126b300512025","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2411.05534, 'Inverse problems for stochastic partial differential equations'] If $ f(\cdot) $ is a simple function in the form (eqSimplefuction of the paper). 
