{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:04:39.788020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55f1643d7b8c9934d67395eb9c1a0aad594925c1ab86ee8417f173a412dd9666","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:harmonic of arXiv:2609.02987, 'Tail Likelihood Reinforcement Learning'] Fix an input $x$ and a parameter $\theta$.
