{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.663004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_562413b7fd6bbb24405e48db0ab244d02128059e5c026c5bf1037aa1d98abfe4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2604.23656, 'Doubly Reflected Backward SDEs Driven by $G$-Brownian Motion with Quadratic Generator'] Given $Z\in BMO_G$, for any $\alpha\geq 1$ and any $t\in[0,T]$, we have 
