{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.994034+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5657ad7d0103f05ea7c099499d465e1e4d00f19cd5acf04d1e42b9a2480d1ea9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 40 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] There exists a constant $C_{29}>0$, which depends on the following values:

