{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.275596+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56819df99b019a5ed0fddf0fb0d4067f2c5c2ac2bb56f25f05b4a0de48b7cac2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2604.07579, 'Topology of Percolation Clusters: Central Limit Theorems beyond the Lattice'] Let $f$ be the growth function of a quasi-transitive
