{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.987536+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56c716a7a8a5c88a23b49c1aac1d68bf34a7960adaff7aa0605ddea0fac2a1ee","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:4.2 of arXiv:2608.27474, 'Nonlocality of Cover-Time Changes Under Edge Addition'] The target coefficients satisfy:

\begin{enumerate}
\def\arabic{enumi}.{\arabic{enumi}.}
