{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.307751+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56e5bb6f57ba1af960c6e89d843a4022e03b944fe73c6c4e27d3c6cbe7ef25c0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 83 (Tightness of all relevant processes) of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] The following are true.
 \begin{enumerate}
