{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.657909+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56ff61bb48b34cf72117ba92905fa62606d15ee40eaf919510273fd0806f2602","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:sign-matrix of arXiv:2604.05941, 'Banach spaces of continuous paths with finite $p$-th variation'] Fix $n \in \mathbb{N}$. The map
