 Assume that $\mathbb{H}$ is the filtration $\mathbb{H}=(\mathscr{H}_t)_{t\ge 0}$ and  $\mathbb{G}=(\mathscr{G}_t)_{t\ge 0}$ is the usual augmentation of $\mathbb{H}$, i.e.
	\begin{equation}
	\mathscr{G}_t=\bigcap_{s>t} \tilde{\mathscr{H}_s} ,\, t\ge 0,
