If a process 	$\mathrm{M}=\left(M_t: t\geq 0\right)$ is a c\`adl\`ag $\mathbb{H}$-martingale on $(\Omega, \mathscr{F}, \mathbb{P})$,		Then, it is also a $\mathbb{G}$-martingale.","status":"unverified"}

