{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.251551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57315d883cfe7853a63ca70bb9128bd1a8f4852ab9bd5c5bf6c9c59c4195164f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem theorem3.2 of arXiv:2412.06246, 'The smallest singular value for rectangular random matrices with Lévy entries'] [[MR131894]]
