{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.088091+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_574fce60d8fce83260e5fe1102ea7be4bb73f0f220b5cc22ddd58c2abc4005cb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 of arXiv:2608.19976, 'Random valuations'] Assume that $\Phi$ is a random valuation almost all of whose
