{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:04:30.582469+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57deb587646858b118f1ff24b456d44f8736b13429d5521ec952a5cc34ebbd3f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:stationary of arXiv:2411.10419, 'Lower bounds on the top Lyapunov exponent for linear PDEs driven by the 2D stochastic Navi'] In the same setting as in Theorem~(thm:main of the paper), define the projective process $ \pi_{t} =
