{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:52:32.334503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57df18b70ab52ccca623ad9ad004629aaf411fcb5b0f1f0e2dea6d69d59ff875","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:similar of arXiv:2609.03980, 'Decay Rates and Domain Dependence of a Coupled Wave-Heat System with Spatially Dependant H'] Consider two $s$-similar admissible Lipschitz pairs $(\Omega_w, \gamma),(\Omega'_w, \gamma')$, $s\neq 0$, and some weight function $p:\mathbb{R} \to [0,\infty)$.
