{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.877968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57e8ba0df93073e1226ca8f10685d192020e199739e0e8a5cd209cf8c22a33fa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2608.29152, 'Uniform Statistical Convergence of Empirical Sinkhorn Potentials\\ with Exponential and Po'] For a continuous cost $c$, define its rectangular interaction oscillation by
