\in\mathcal H_{\mathrm{CNN}}
(T,B,\bm L,\bm k,\bm{\mathcal P},\bm C,\bm m)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:04:30.598896+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_580558f83cce21bdc14fc4940d85a8105751a4b8025215f8248fd53b4e31a6ab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition recurrence of arXiv:2411.10502, 'Strategies in a mis\`{e}re two-player tree search game'] We have the recurrence 
