{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.217898+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_584e64e5a3568a2f640ba3014f94545d40915ce7cda3ac4398d5a9679edfd33e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem conjecture:MCG-reducible-generators of arXiv:2609.00233, 'A survey on mapping class groups of 3-manifolds'] Every mapping class in $\pi_0\Diff_\partial (M)$ is a composition of:
