{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:32:34.745583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_590eeff82db23c5081bbf20d01994801bbf92c73ef8acf6bf12469c0caccb187","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma rho of arXiv:2411.07878, 'Bernstein-type and Bennett-type inequalities for unbounded matrix martingales'] Fix $\lambda > 0$, $\alpha > 0$. Define the function
