{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.115430+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_592a8526ced1f7c4dd267ad965d98a90e29f128af95822e40d314ab98e53f47d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 ({cf. \cite[Proposition 4.1) of arXiv:2608.27398, 'Strict Stability and Strict Minimality of Regular Area-Minimizing Hypercones: A Quantitati'] {de2014sharp}}]
