{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:32:58.351733+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a1077e6630a69051f18bbefbfba1e6067c7284cdd151b5ecdbc07d2b60e82b6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:tPsiN-expanded of arXiv:2506.06559, 'Bi-infinite incipient cluster in high dimensions'] For $N \ge 1$, $n' \ge 2$ and $u, x' \in \mathbb{Z}^d$ we have
