{ \widetilde{\Psi}^{(N)}(F;u,x')
  = & \sum_{u',v'} \left[ \hat\Psi^{N,0}(F;u,u',v')+\sum_{N'=1}^{n'} (-1)^{N'} \Psi^{N,N'}(F;u,u') \right] 
    p D(u',v') \tau(v',x') \\
    & + \sum_{N'=0}^{n'} (-1)^{N'} \Psi^{N,N'}(F;u,x') + R^{N,n'}(F;u,x'). }
Furthermore, for $N = 0$, $n' \ge 2$ and $u,v, x' \in \mathbb{Z}^d$ we have
