    & + \sum_{N'=0}^{n'} (-1)^{N'} \hat\Psi^{0,N'}(F;u,v,x') + R^{0,n'}(F;u,x'). } (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.223635+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a129dd51e196f4f2a1c31aa8e2469088114f201aaaa9c6f1fd1ad0f9dcc6fc3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma low1 of arXiv:2412.09471, 'On the moderate deviation principles in the sparse multi-type Erd\H{o}s R\'enyi random gra'] For any scaling sequence $n^{\frac{1}{4}}\ll a_n\ll\sqrt{n}$ and $\beta>0$,
