{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.123161+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a593705f752aec842fbe4a34f62cf7a381e322947c1cdbc11076b14f9131dc6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:disi of arXiv:2602.00853, 'Mixing times for the stochastic $p$-Laplace equation'] Let $r\geq 1$ be fixed.
