		Let $r=0,\ldots,\alpha-k-1$ with $t:=\alpha-k-r=O(M)$. Then $$\mathbb{E}(\Pi_t1_{\mathcal{P}_t^{\delta}}|S_r)\leq\exp\left((\tfrac{1}{2\mu_2}+o(1))t\log\log\alpha+O(\tfrac1{\delta}k)\right).$$","status":"unverified"}

