{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.590613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c30a59c9e079624a738eebb57e85457b533b0e88e9f3438ffffdae19bf86900","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:Holder of arXiv:2606.02003, 'Higher-Order Multifractional Stable Motion:\\ Definition and Fundamental Properties'] For a stochastic process $\{X(t)\}_{t \in \mathbb{R}}$ and
