{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.368652+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c470ca82beeb13d8a2293f60029dced1d1d386359e14fe32ab17307cbc6d21b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:vol:cond of arXiv:2607.20956, 'Sharp moduli of continuity for Gaussian fields and stochastic PDEs via correlation bounds'] If $\phi$ satisfies Assumptions (a:kappa of the paper) and (a:sv of the paper) with $a>1/2$, then
