the open triangle $0<x<y<1$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:29:14.964956+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c68d17f71bace26094e3a5d8b34fae3531ea6dea1b1ba5da6982afb9bd268e0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:com_tim of arXiv:2606.14895, 'Effective Resistances and Commute Times in Sparse Random Geometric Graphs'] For any $u,v\in V$, the commute time $C_{uv}$ between $u$ and $v$ satisfies
