{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:04:39.796498+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c7f6d1e2d861a44a4bb8153f249b28bacddd058134e11336e875edfb118638b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:tailrl-binary-recovery of arXiv:2609.02987, 'Tail Likelihood Reinforcement Learning'] Suppose $r_i\in\{0,1\}$ and let
