{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.607491+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5cbf54ba24ad8bce60442d5ec51faefba3ac1e190dcb533732ff72d60bc0c7ea","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Cyclotomic fibers) of arXiv:2608.25725, 'Gr\"obner Bases for Alexander Fitting Ideals of Links'] For every divisor \(\delta\mid q\) with \(\delta>1\),
