{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.072596+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5cc210f5c497e3019646b8f196dc577333bf5abcaf9aa2c675621d84eecc5fce","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo thm:random-energy-density of arXiv:2509.08928, 'The near critical random bond Ising model via embedding deformation'] In the previous setup, one has $\mathbf{P}$-almost surely, 
