{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.868110+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d0fc53a1dcd652fb41ce9d3a62e17f48c9b84c06e7f0355e7db44a9301cdb9b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor tree-consensus-upper of arXiv:2609.03856, 'Consensus time for asynchronous $\ell^p$ relaxation: graph dependence'] For $f_0\in[-1,1]^V$ and $0<\epsilon\le1$,
\begin{equation}
 \mathbb{E}\tau_p(\epsilon;f_0)\le C_pnT_G\log(n/\epsilon)
