{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.675980+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d4499b8b8680c9f9c7dc8c229bdbd318e0fd49d4a92f3cdc78a78234b6ee40f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:boundnabalvgauss of arXiv:2411.10235, '\textbf{Smooth transport map via diffusion process}'] For all $t\in [0,1)$ and $x\in \mathbb{R}^d$,  we have 
