{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:24:20.640692+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d69d1bedd3d86846946ae1741a7c63c64ea4dd6e59bee077fe89d4622143e4b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] The basic random matrices $Z\in M_N(L^\infty(X))$ are as follows:
