{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.924017+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5deef2fc1d5255719031ae16b43ec84e9700bb6620e51e36cd805e67b3b1413c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_revise_B1 of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $x\in \mathbb{Z}^d$ and disjoint $A,D\subset \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d\setminus \widetilde{B}_x(2)$,
		\begin{equation}
