        	\cdots \longrightarrow H^{i}(B) \rightarrow H^{i}(E) \xrightarrow{ \ \delta_{i}  \ } H^{i-k}(B) \rightarrow H^{i+1}(B) \longrightarrow \cdots,
        	\end{align*}
        	we call $\delta_{i}:H^{i}(E) \longrightarrow H^{i-k}(B)$ \textbf{the connecting homomorphism in degree $i$}.","status":"unverified"}

