{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.724102+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5f815b9bb4fac3ff5498f3bca5a2ab0f692b0b5939a872f66d989c749b889bc4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary coro: levy1 bounded support of arXiv:2411.04238, 'Holomorphic jump-diffusions'] Fix $S\subseteq\mathbb R$ and let  $X=(X_t)_{t\in[0,T]}$ be an $S$-valued Lévy process with characteristics $(b,a,F)$. Assume that $F$ has bounded support and set
 \begin{align*}
