{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.172146+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5faf7ed874a2eb4095e294f480f69aaa45cb2b69d1abad60b1a0f8ab1a4b4879","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_TransversalityCriterion_HarmonicSpinors of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] Let $B$ be a manifold and \  $\Gamma \mskip0.5mu\colon\thinspace B \to \mathbf{Dir}$ a smooth map.
