{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.241385+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fbf677ed0a52dad6034cf6604809bb3da351686e87a304a201cdca6f8bb5ae8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm phase_transition_321 of arXiv:2604.23751, 'Large deviation principles for pattern-avoiding permutations, and limit shapes for constra'] For $\beta >0,$ we let
