{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.161931+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fc856750c08a0f0d217c4cd333de7ad910f795bc3d8308158f609e011b957f0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_UniversalBundleOfZ2ZSpinors of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] The \defined{universal bundle of $\mathbb{Z}/2\mathbb{Z}$ spinors}
  \begin{equation*}
    {\mathbf{E}}_{0} \coloneq \ker \mathbf{res} \subseteq \mathbf{E}
  \end{equation*}
  is a tame Fréchet space subbundle.
  Moreover,
  the exact sequence
  \begin{equation*}
    {\mathbf{E}}_{0} \hookrightarrow \mathbf{E} \stackrel{\mathbf{res}}{\twoheadrightarrow} \mathbf{G}
  \end{equation*}
  of tame Fréchet space bundles locally splits;
  that is:
  for every $({\mathbf{p}},[{\mathfrak l}]) \in \mathbf{Dir} \times \mathbf{Ram}$
  there are an open neighbourhood $({\mathbf{p}},[{\mathfrak l}]) \in \mathscr{U} \subseteq \mathbf{Dir} \times \mathbf{Ram}$ and
  a map of tame Fréchet space bundles $\mathbf{ext} \mskip0.5mu\colon\thinspace \mathbf{G}|_\mathscr{U} \to \mathbf{E}|_\mathscr{U}$ satisfying $\mathbf{res} \circ \mathbf{ext} = \mathbf{1}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.360662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fca2fefad3a5d945372715484bf86a284dd9af686dc5e755061bf5cb2670aa2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] $\big(\widetilde{N}_j:h_*< j\le h^*\big)$ are independent. Each $\widetilde{N}_j$ follows the same law as 
