{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.907318+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fd2b0fd88c377e8999f9b79ed4d20c261acbba0c682c07c45c4054e52b47dcb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:good-event of arXiv:2608.26745, 'Moderate Deviations for the Largest Eigenvalue of a Randomly Deformed Gaussian Unitary Ens'] There are constants $c,C>0$ such that
