{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.761129+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5fec444246acf1eef8160137abfdb7a6b52314a577144a7f43167216fbd6c723","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 (Lamperti representation and exact occupation threshold) of arXiv:2608.30178, '2608.30178'] Assume that
\begin{equation}
 r_{10}\ge1,
 \qquad b_{11}=0\ \text{or}\ r_{11}=r_{10}+1,
 \qquad b_{12}=0\ \text{or}\ r_{12}=\alpha_1+r_{10}-1,

