{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:49.831836+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ffc939dc620e8de432a9ba4bba0cccdb377dd4e623276d7f8edd488b6baab22","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 2 of arXiv:2506.12145, 'Functional central limit theorem for dependent models with finite memory'] We have the almost sure convergence,
