{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.516917+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_61045d1865e371ea79d93508d97bea911918f15f58664adabfe09927c5e7dccf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem rigorous-w123 of arXiv:2601.19145, 'Stochastic Persistence in Infinite Dimensions'] For $W_1, W_2$ from (equation w123 of the paper) we have $W_1,W_2 \in \tilde{\mathcal{D}}^{ext}_+(\mathcal{M})$ and with $x = (rv, z)$:
