in \(C([0,1],\mathbb R^d)\).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:43:04.661514+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_614cb11e8d122aa45b6707f14b5c3d529d929b9d497f062df9b5e840a0b493e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2605.17296, 'Zero correlations and averaged fields of orthonormal Gaussian Functions'] For $n, n' \in \N_0$ and $z,w \in \C$, 
