{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.722518+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62076cf0d81b055301f9e23197ec3400975f5a03dab1dbf3354585121969b5e5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma finitepoments of arXiv:2411.04238, 'Holomorphic jump-diffusions'] Consider a subset $\mathcal V$ such that
