{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:43:00.030261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62255bbb38bbf7331878b0f9f6a4155dc894093a46f63fe9fc160f46ffe93b76","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 7 of arXiv:2609.00736, 'Modalities in non-classical variations of S4'] Let $M = \tuple{W, W^\bot, \preceq, \R, V}$ be a birelational $\csf$-model.
