{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.800662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6245a2653f5d0cc0e6adf10ce0771f1de27df8ae4dc982a2c34260d9b168fcf3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:ratio of arXiv:2510.05850, 'Three-point connectivity constant for $q$-state Potts spin clusters'] We have $\widetilde\SLE_\kappa^\mathrm{sep}=\mathsf{C}(\kappa)^{-2} \,\SLE_\kappa^\mathrm{sep}$, with the positive constant $\mathsf{C}(\kappa)$ given by
