{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:06:18.057969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6247d6f946eb9f64f067d68b23ffa32483ed19e131f482ba18eaff28abad41f3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 34 of arXiv:2608.15914, 'Absorption cutoff and stationary singularities for rounded Gaussian random dynamical syste'] Let $I\Subset(0,1)$. There is a constant $C_I<\infty$ such that, for every
