{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.261027+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62ddb2d7ba0daa54892e6b3702f5c11d08bd43b88a65d7259732df2a060ba2fe","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 9 (see \cite{paper1}) of arXiv:2609.01114, 'Unbalanced spectral Tur\'an problem for color-critical graphs with prescribed large maximu'] Let $F$ be a graph with $\chi(F)=r+1\ge3$.  Define
	\begin{equation*}
