{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:06:39.356338+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62e1b9f79f788608a291410e6bdd81ceac3ebf6320d6ca96185dc3257374539b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:compactness of arXiv:2607.15140, 'On the absence of blow-up in the 3D Navier-Stokes equations with transport noise'] Fix 
$$
