{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:46.459918+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62f05f2ee42fc2b38b4733eb0145ea8edb42c9585ae6695df10a46e470c9c2ed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (\cite{fEhRjS2019}*{Theorem 3.45 and Remark 3.55}) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Let $d= 1$, $N = 0$, and 
