{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.731751+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_62f4eade01e42580ecc7c7c870e0e3d4813d92c1548fdd6350ad3927407430f5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lA4cor of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in(0,p)$
\begin{equation}\begin{aligned}
