with initial condition $\big(X^\delta_0, V^\delta_0 \big)= (x,v)\in \mathbb{T}^3\times \mathbb{R}^3$. Moreover, $\|f^\delta_t \|_{L^p_{x,v}} = \|f^\delta_0 \|_{L^p_{x,v}}$ for any $p\ge 1$.","status":"unverified"}

