\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.122696+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_63c445b02ac19160c6a0620e6d3f55e3dabd1b1dc6b1d2106da9bb100cd2aca6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:unit-modulus of arXiv:2608.18293, 'Critical tensor covariance at the Marchenko--Pastur threshold'] Assume (equation eq:base-assumptions of the paper), $v=0$, $p=\binom nd\to\infty$,
