where
$\xi_0(\e)$
is defined by \eqref{ex1-1-1}.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.501468+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_63d3181469f424b44a9e3bf354cfdd4fd582c366f6715b5f6621b74b99b3b070","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2608.30578, 'Compactly Supported Solutions near a Nehari Critical Value'] Assume that $0<\alpha<1$, $m\in L^\infty(\Omega)$, and $\lambda<0$.
