    Then, $\phi$ is a \emph{$(\Theta, \rho)$}-martingale on the stochastic interval $[S,\tau]$, that is, for any  $\nu_1$ $\in$ $\Theta$, and $\nu_2$ $\in$ $\Theta$, such that $S \leq \nu_1 \leq \nu_2 \leq \tau$ a.s.,
