{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.161728+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6432659dd22e427c44b40c781f72754c5cd78d0e562523aef653a7fc351c4046","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem ThmKL of arXiv:2608.28949, 'The information geometry of product-reference discrete diffusion: Interaction growth compl'] Assume that the mixed partial derivatives appearing
in~(LemExactKL of the paper) are continuous on the compact log-odds region
