{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:33:12.350317+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64499f8171933eae32856c5d3ae770afe64f52070ae0cb53b13e50018d058913","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Ppn 178 (quenched estimates for $\vD$ and $\vD^\frozen$) of arXiv:2608.29416, 'Algorithmic threshold for high-dimensional projection pursuit I: general theory'] We have
	\[\frac{\bE[( D^\RomI(t)-D^\RomI(s))^2]}{(t-s)^2}
