{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.247457+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6453277f2131e3f041624b6257d041f7bd4f54c6cfd7e39b3e0610a7dc4ab6aa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:PP conv of arXiv:2607.01946, 'Second-order fluctuations for a phase transition in random partitions'] For $(p_n = P_n^\downarrow)_{n\in{\mathbb N}}$ from the $(\alpha,\theta)$-partitions (i.e., as in (equation eq:p_n CRP of the paper)), we have
