{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.161234+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6467a20761093b73e8f3f447d8569f00ddb1b58d1ec229752b08c2b78f625926","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem ThmMaster of arXiv:2608.28949, 'The information geometry of product-reference discrete diffusion: Interaction growth compl'] For any grid~(equation EqnGrid of the paper) of the interval $[r_0, R]$, the
