{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.354623+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_64c2a90a963bfc6a42234521bf8e0903ff505722343233de50dcb697f8f4a01e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2606.17501, 'Critical spectral behavior and large deviations for geometric $\alpha$-stable processes'] For a non-negative function $w \in C_{0}(\bR^{d})$ with $w \not\equiv 0$,
