{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:48:27.278645+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6561333ddea1dc5e8a8851ed8fb537774817dfa9740d49be221d92648386a105","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2604.24684, 'Waning Immunity Fails to Restore a Positive Epidemic Threshold on Power--Law Networks'] Let $G_\star$ denote the star graph on vertex set $\{v,u_1,\dots, u_k\}$ with center $v$. 
