{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.212364+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6592c1df42ede31da5964b95769be228e4b4354dffd48790811c4b1946abfa42","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem tail-randomization of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] For every integer $1\le s\ler_{\star}$,
