{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.504923+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6593322c0c4546c7394239e2ed23c219d5c65151ea1541ec0b1893e0ea9ef32f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 87 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] Let $V$ be another Banach space. Then for all $Y \in L(V,D(A))$ and all $s,t \in [0,T]$ we have
