    \begin{align*}
    |\{A\in \mathfrak{A}_2\,|\,  |  \partial ^2 A|=n \}|\le C^{n}.
    \end{align*}
\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.706284+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_66fa8381e29b7e9f8984de1a8e47ce1fb11ec6f65750c3f10ff726bf9d53568a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 (Wrapped kinetic kernels) of arXiv:2609.02196, 'Schr\"odinger Bridges on Lie Group Manifolds for Probabilistic Intrinsic Generation'] For a lift \(z\in\R^m\) of \(g_0^{-1}g\),
\begin{equation}
