{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.042352+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67200b0789d1439588a40c48aa46be2217e8da8813be6759bac83e5fa7349dfb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 (Lemma 3.6 of \cite{Chen2024} at $n=8$) of arXiv:2608.26598, 'Pinching cones for positive isotropic curvature in dimensions seven and eight'] Let $n=8$ and $0<b\le b_{max}$. Then, with $a,\gamma,\omega,A,P,Q$ as in \eqref{data},
