{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.653895+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67296f063daf60182bc888c95199252dfb4c29081c0cdf9e667e1cbe8524fb80","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2605.07184, 'Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with mini-batching and infinite variance'] Under the assumption of \Cref{th:averaging_stable_convergence}, the matrices $G_{N,i}$
