{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.912592+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6750ff629535b1753310a09b9dcdb7f055b79894b24147546c85943f3b81f1b6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main theorem of arXiv:2411.00663, 'Ergodicity and Mixing of invariant capacities and applications'] Suppose that $\{f_n\}_{n\in\mathbb{N}}$ is a sequence of $\mathcal{F}$-measurable functions satisfying the following conditions:
