&\quad + \pi \lambda^{3/2}\int_{0}^{\infty}\int_{h_1\rho_1(\theta)}^{\infty}\int_{0}^{\infty}\, e^{-(\lambda\pi+\gamma) \hat{h}^2} {\rm d}t \,{\rm d}h_2 \, {\rm d}h_1 ,
