Here, the constant $A:=\frac{8\sqrt{3}\,\pi \sin\!\left(\frac{2\pi}{9}\right)}{135\cos\!\left(\frac{5\pi}{18}\right)}\in(0,\infty)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

