{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:57:59.889791+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67e98b2df688722661d17d32799960038c5fd286bd92211594082079fae7060f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lambdasigma_Eucli_RRW of arXiv:2607.09946, 'Statistics on Yau's conjecture: Variance asymptotics'] If $\alpha\in [0,1)$, we have that
