{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.624941+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_67ed92eb32bf71f04f569ed0adf98dd16bcc589431d1b17e940c57e6fd9a1c0d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Charact of Gamma of arXiv:2411.03512, 'Ergodicity and Mixing of Sublinear Expectation System and Applications'] For any $X=(X_1,\cdots,X_d)\in \mathcal{H}^d$  such that $X\sim \Gamma$, we have
