{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.608565+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_680887ffb59dce14a3be4796884a042491f37b045a15ab01c40d32bf75cf29c3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2604.04747, 'Scaling limit and density conjecture for activated random walk on the complete graph'] \thlabel{lem:max-tail}
