{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:25:44.992622+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_682bf7c74dcd89e7afc15b200ed7476efb3248c23aaed5a9f77e122e15be00f5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2605.11801, 'A non-local singular non-linear Fokker-Planck PDE'] Let $g\in C_T\shc^{(-\be)+}$.  Let us consider the sequence $(g_n)$ defined by
