{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.318673+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_687152bc7f78395d3c826b92a37d143ac404e7294d6d31867335187c915a3568","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Orb-Glo-cleft of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Write ${\vphantom{\textup{t}}\smash{\textup{Orb}}}\subset\textup{Glo}$ for the wide subcategory given by the \emph{injective} homomorphisms. Then ${\vphantom{\textup{t}}\smash{\textup{Orb}}}\subset\textup{Glo}$ is a cleft.
