{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.626480+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_692dc827b276a21b158dc976a93d5b2d83cee429eaabfdf8742a649a3a91c3d7","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn of arXiv:2411.09988, 'A Study in Markov Chains, Loop-Erased Random Walk and Loop Soups'] \hfill\\
