{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:51:12.741635+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6a0a7757f2a0dad725f645b3fda2727578686d4dfe0a2e1348bc5288ac12825d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2605.02430, '\textbf{Scaling limit of the range of tree-valued branching random walks in random environ'] We assume that $\mu$ satisfies (\ref{hypostaintro}). Recall from (\ref{bnBiGoTe}) the definition of the slowly varying function $L\! : \! (0, \infty) \! \to \! (0, \infty)$.  
