  \end{equation}
  for any $\alpha \in \N_0^d$ such that $\lvert \alpha \rvert \leq m$ and $x \in D$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:45:05.525152+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6a2f77c05ba3d1dfb7c71eddf6702c7271893f44ae17e10fc7750ab59b67ca3a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 22 of arXiv:2608.05185, '\large\bf ON THE HEAT FLOW CONJECTURE FOR RANDOM MATRICES'] Almost surely, there is a sequence
