{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.028887+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ad20a339275f96f7689a3b78d6c858be4453fcb4d2ff31c825b593954f10348","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Pro 12 of arXiv:2609.02879, 'On the cut locus of Hamilton--Jacobi equations I: structure and propagation via the touchi'] Let \( \Omega \subset \R^n \) be an open convex subset and $\phi\in\text{\rm SCL}\,(\Omega)$. Then
