{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:35:57.004275+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b3369ad5c2044cd5aed080dac1f1f5c5210bc2ec3547b7e5eacc1c2b2009366","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma E[multi_edges]_asymp of arXiv:2604.05921, 'Simplicity of random hypergraphs'] If $\forall e \in E: \delta_e = \delta\in O(1)$ and 
