{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.316117+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b46dba95a7dae7aec0dd525cb13abf0144cbf993ffd09b56f30c8f90cbef5b7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop ;pp of arXiv:2604.12462, 'Stochastic analysis of Beckner's and related functional inequalities'] For every $4/3<p<2$, it holds that 
