{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.224164+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b4a0b88baf9742fc9a12fff1cc163b897b22d82084540d1c88c824ee1d42b09","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm3 of arXiv:2412.09471, 'On the moderate deviation principles in the sparse multi-type Erd\H{o}s R\'enyi random gra'] Fix $k\in{\mathbb N}^d$,  as $n\rightarrow\infty$,
