{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.360085+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6bad003f6b21128a000193b4a609df6c3b46896b8171ee46a2dc09cf1d9701bd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:conv:marginalInformation of arXiv:2412.07710, 'An H-theorem for a conditional McKean-Vlasov process related to interacting diffusions on '] Suppose $\nu \in W^{1, 1}((\ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^d)^{1 + \kappa})$. Then, we have
