where $\Theta$ denotes the set of all possible estimators  of $p^\star$ based on n sample.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.242394+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6cad83e5a053eecd4fb5ada7fea6930779e13a64045ed58a074726d6ef5a0761","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem construction_muf of arXiv:2604.23751, 'Large deviation principles for pattern-avoiding permutations, and limit shapes for constra'] Let $f\in\mathcal{F}$.
