{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.244551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6d8007f66cbd71b00166e21312234fdc48d61b970fdac0dda14825bb64246dfd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2605.26439, '2605.26439'] Let $T>0$. Assume that $B\in\mathcal L(U;\mathcal H_{-\eta})$ for some $\eta\in[0,1)$ and that there exists $\beta\in(0,1/2)$ such that
