{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:25:55.318939+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6db768bd48ef58467932b716da3b52ac1f49cc2bef98fe1c816be48c5a774603","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2607.27786, 'Gaussian free field in annulus: \\BPZ equations and crossing probabilities for level lines'] Fix $n\ge 1$ and $\bs{\alpha}, \bs{\beta}\in\LX_n$. The partition function $\LZcro{n}$~\eqref{eqn::LZcro_def} has the following asymptotic as $r\to\infty$: 
\begin{align}
