{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.281695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6dd3b982fde48b32d8039954cf5af178d8e4b52257ec72ee6dd41f006e6a0a25","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2606.22611, 'Upper and Lower Bounds on Expected Soft Maxima\\of Gaussian Processes'] Let $\mu$ be rational. For any $\epsilon>0$, we have 
