{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.491155+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ddf0636e39341f7bce7b1c3cc693aded6c99f31985267d75d4ea50881e7b12c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 (Triangular dependence of $\Pi^-$) of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] ~
