				\|Q_{+}u(t)\|_{L^{\infty}} \le R_{Q,\infty}, \quad t\in\R.
			\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.544893+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6e15d8f7593352016742438ea2d78b485e0040d9d655f18041389527b642b97f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:ode of arXiv:2603.28161, 'Boundary four-point connectivities of conformal loop ensembles'] For $\kappa\in(4,8)$ and $p\in\mathscr{P}$, $U^p(\lambda)$ is smooth and solves the following third-order ODE
\begin{equation}
