\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.687427+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6e1732ed846a91787c9cd63191fc4f8221bab9d8399f4bbbdc5043fdd9a198c4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:pi-moments of arXiv:2603.20078, '\bf \Large Gated Infinite Server Queues in Light Traffic'] In the framework of this section, assume that the service time
