{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.521868+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6ecaa308801396ae859c63e88f18244c9b46ccf56ee006270b293dd01b3185c6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:RGP-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] Let $H = \ell^2(\mathbb{Z})$.  The seed functions
