{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.614979+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f7e6486a7e1663ed14ecf160d3c69dd896e22b14388362655983c69bc543ecf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:so-nn of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d>2$,
