{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.845104+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6fb47926e23773fd70c856fe0a34e0b76cd743f412e34bdbb625895bb102fc42","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop_1 of arXiv:2603.26307, '\LARGE The incompressible Navier--Stokes--Fourier system with thermal noise'] For every $\delta,\epsilon\in(0,1)$, there exists a weak martingale solutions to  (equation Eq_approx of the paper) with initial data $(u_0,\psi_0)$, which satisfies
