{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.473755+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7039f65bedacaace11b2f3199c2632e902d4072984c64695172bfb9eac55aa7e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop FunL-presentable of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] If ${\mathcal{D}},{\mathcal{E}}$ are $T$-presentable, then so is $\ul{\textup{Fun}}_T^\textup{L}({\mathcal{D}},{\mathcal{E}})$.
    \begin{proof}
