{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.694514+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_713c0c2ab9573956e17e01945f9a4864f55ce3c3ed8db19790a9dce9b73fac8f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem M1_tightness_time_changed of arXiv:2605.29073, 'Volterra clocks and their pure-jump limits: \\hitting times of curved boundaries'] We have
