{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.929002+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_723c503ec8da1a0ddb0357773bde8fae83152e5a1b49b1c6e3cef27ec9fbcab4","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 64 of arXiv:2608.26084, 'Localic Esakia Duality\\via Conic Frames'] An \emph{Esakia frame} is a pair~$(E,\dc)$ such that:
