{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.389809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_73815deffc626a3b49ce381cbaa9203b0d6657fd3c45f80dc70ce54c58c6da16","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:local_subgraph_clt_norho of arXiv:2507.10531, 'Quantitative central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] Under the same assumption as in Corollary (cor:local_subgraph_clt of the paper),
