{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.790256+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7416e1565bfd5d5e84f0c9fb4e2184f404a4b0e59d3dab20fe2845a0882340de","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 61 (Truncated two-dimensional Gaussian free field) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] For $N\geqs1$, let $\cK_N = \setsuch{k\in\Z^2}{\abs{k} \leqs N}$,
