{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.627933+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_741ecdc98d1d369797bc6351d1af8c6744536d9483f32c4a034965506b6c2a1d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 9 of arXiv:2609.00598, 'Supercritical mean--field limit for magnetized Hamiltonian dynamics'] Let the assumptions of {\rm Theorem \ref{Well posedness of EB}} hold.  Assume 
