{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:00:46.822241+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_74b5a63b9b17c69bfeac1ff30c86c31d9162ab32876be3f63239c95e5b35f796","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 21 of arXiv:2608.13208, 'Universality in dimension $1$ of kinetically constrained lattice gases'] For an admissible flow $\phi$ we define (when
