{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.806944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_752836494a451ae11e4a1aae93010d16342fdef4611c9c9fdb9fffb5994f473e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 72 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Assume that  $\rU$ is a topological vector space and $\rU^\prime$ its topological dual.
