{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.354834+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75d2a5ba80d4eabfa721152b744a75007991e4555931652f30a06c044bb2da98","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem UniformFCLT of arXiv:2412.01635, 'On the Weak Convergence of the Function-Indexed Sequential Empirical Process and its Smoot'] (Asymptotic equicontinuity)\\

