{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.786030+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75ebc65d1ada7f7811068dbc7a5daccd7d1ab58da85d815bc67cafb905aed601","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2604.00598, 'Allowing for Imprecision in the Game-theoretic Characterisation of the Poisson Process'] For all \(\stopt\in\stopts\), \(f\in\stoptdom\) and \(\pth\in\set{\stopt<+\infty}\),
