{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.539530+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75f396c1030fa110cd906b1f2e5ad863d9af8029e165093add603b12d345e0bc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:B-preimage of arXiv:2411.12003, 'Central Limit Theorem for non-stationary random products of $\SL(2, \R)$ matrices'] For any $B\in {\mathrm{SL}}(2,{\mathbb R})$ for at least one of two coordinate vectors $e_j$ one has
