{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.612277+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76003f7d89b48da4971f48668fff93f3a5ea3bfebafad6c575712be1f9ccaa3f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 37 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] For $2a_n+1>2/\beta$, we have 
