{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.350284+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76d81d0d4abab6dd1e1c76cd18689537ae9e9c95f95bd5d3490a77ede0c0d8e9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 31 of arXiv:2511.06414, 'Non-uniform Edgeworth expansions for weakly dependent random variables and their applicati'] Let  Assumptions \ref{AssRDF}  and \ref{Per} hold, and suppose that $\sig>0$.
