{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.455284+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76d85d970bd145d2ce89817fa25de53061bf7ae0439de039e3b6ff74193c03a8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 3 (Critical slope inflation at wave breaking) of arXiv:2609.02523, '\bf Strong Ill-Posedness in critical and subcritical regimes for the Hunter--Saxton equati'] Let $u_0\in C_c^\infty(\R)$, and denote $u$ the corresponding strong solution of
