{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.624872+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_76e8ea2b7400554faa17c5a7d50066b1ef8e4959016db087d81356ec1c55f36e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Suf cond for admissible 1 of arXiv:2411.03512, 'Ergodicity and Mixing of Sublinear Expectation System and Applications'] Let $g: \mathbb N\to \mathbb R_+$ be a given function. If there exists $\delta>0$ such that
