{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.667277+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77263c68c2c933812a6828c350a40393b2246734feffaa0d43791102fd829494","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 (Marginal cut balance) of arXiv:2607.20823, 'Fluctuation impossibility results for stochastic burst networks'] For every $i\in\{1,\dots,N\}$ and every $j\ge1$,
