{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.163821+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7747b8b089d2d592a9a642f1eb4752e4903d8754fa21147590ca4fc439a54a49","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_ThickenedSpaceOfZ2ZHarmonicSpinors_Submanifold+Submersion of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] For every $({\mathbf{p}}_0,[{\mathfrak l}_0];\Phi_0) \in \mathbf{Harm}^*$
