    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.483297+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_775b2552730b88a2de09ab01821692207667041c83e099517de4f557aa5ba898","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 41 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let be $\eta>0$, $\varepsilon\in (0,1)$ and $b\geq (2v)\vee(2\lambda)$.
