{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.303380+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_77aee101107564502c4e9de66844291bcfc7e9ea512672b4b46ea11e079bcffb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.21816, 'On P\'olya's 4D random walk constant'] In dimension 4, the return probability is given by
\begin{equation*}
p(4)=1-1/u(4)=0.1932016732\ldots, 
