{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.730552+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7876cce8bbb3e7281d9ed956cb43f54e9143af1448391967f7948452b4dbd7f2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 1 of arXiv:2609.01237, ''] For any given function $f \in H^{\half}(\Gamma_1)$,  the  problem
