{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:40:59.378568+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_787b91166faf2f9e8e6277ab33eeb107de607d3ab11f2799e48eab0b259e8ce2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Frank--Seiringer \cite{FS08}) of arXiv:2609.03962, '$L^p$ isomorphisms for the fractional Laplacian on $\mathbb{R}^n$ and their application'] Let $n\ge1$, $s\in(0,1)$, and $sp>n$. Then
