{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.499252+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_787db4efec8625d82fa3a8bd0a37136e102046fe370fb9dd30e96eae8a02d24c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:IBJ-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] Let $H = \ell^2(\mathbb{Z})$.  The seed functions
