{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.894249+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a1e0d6185a7ee404313a3741b02166c7c8fff18a15c3ad4d3b8ff2c5c6b83b8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma inhomoesti of arXiv:2606.31155, 'The well-posedness of stochastic Korteweg--de Vries equations revisited'] Let $s\in \mathbb{R}$, $0<\epsilon<1$, $0<T<1$. Then
