{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.763994+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a25557958bd5ca4461526bb6646d85c3dd42d11279ec1eacebdf0a808ba2d5a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 11 (Signature of tfBm) of arXiv:2512.04646, '\textbf{Canonical Rough Path over Tempered Fractional Brownian Motion: Existence, Construc'] The \emph{signature} of $\mathbf{B}_{H,\lambda}$ over $[s,t]$ is
