{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:40:26.998748+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a267899995a344f67b6cf853d2319a13dc7e997eca38035f67fc6cad46324c9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition thm:expectation-variance of arXiv:2604.17253, 'Large Deviations for the Nonlinear Schrödinger Equation with Randomized Quasi-Periodic Ini'] Let randomized field $f(\boldsymbol{x})$ be defined as in (equation eq:randomqp_d of the paper). Then the following properties hold:
