				\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.006002+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7a3c745fc60206d7c7e234a67baac53028242c4c5e090aab8c0c2c72744e9654","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 (Basic Properties of Wishart Matrices) of arXiv:2609.02790, 'Full-Model Optimality for Tunable Linear Generative Priors in Compressed Sensing'] If $W\sim \mathcal W_p(\Sigma,n)$, then:
