{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.525269+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ace914ed835e6a89f80b5b2100519a0a53b3df702ee5b36ba40c24a55bed9a7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eq:theta_upper_semi_continuity of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{prop:theta_upper_semi_continuity}
