{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:10.888784+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7afc37a5645b1b6cb7d9e375800115ac256770cd5de390996c879951198f4114","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 33 (Phase transition for Poisson-Voronoi percolation) of arXiv:2504.02435, 'Poisson-Voronoi percolation in higher rank'] Let $G$ be a non-compact connected semisimple real Lie group and $(X,d_X)$ be its symmetric space. Fix $\lambda>0$. Then 
