{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.666037+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b628c740a15b3a3dde3c58edbb3cff94e3b4572190bf327e9584f6c98c562aa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:kesten-visit-before-exit of arXiv:2411.10113, 'Long-range one-dimensional\\ internal diffusion-limited aggregation'] Suppose that~(equation ass:irreducible of the paper) holds. Fix  $0 \le y <1$ and $c>0$.  
