{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.134778+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7bad4c4d8cc9563e50c9e26f487e42aa237f58dc6885b5810cf38f0feef3ce68","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 14 of arXiv:2608.26698, 'Mapping class groups of simply connected closed spin 5-manifolds with no 2- and 3-torsion '] Let $M$ be a simply connected closed spin 5-manifold.
