{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.480348+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7cb517213ccaad2030eca17f68995f3cfdfe8d6cacc4cab7870089ef28e398a7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 2 (Theorem \ref{Thm A E FPS}) of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] The indicator function $\ind_{\Ns_{\varepsilon}(A)}$ satisfies the following asymptotic expansion:
