{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:52:32.333084+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7cba87f859eb3c16a098515aa71151f63fdfb09036e4b2febca696d5605a95b8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:mildsolutions of arXiv:2609.03980, 'Decay Rates and Domain Dependence of a Coupled Wave-Heat System with Spatially Dependant H'] For each accretive $S\in L^\infty(\Omega_h,\mathbb{C}^{n\times n}) $,
