{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.179230+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7cd4de3bfc1a167e8ca7f525511effaa9dd7e25c03671c94537962d370ce13cc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:p>2 of arXiv:2602.03058, '\vspace{-3em} Moments of sums of exponentials, beyond CHS'] Let $p \geq 2$. For every $n \geq 1$ and real numbers $x_1, \dots, x_n$, we have
