{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.712782+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d0e43f019a1b4c719d8e1fba7364855a9a3b0ac7ca0385b4d312e1e8f393578","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.29736, '2608.29736'] Let $(M^n,\omega)$ be a compact K\"ahler manifold of complex
