{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.525418+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d1f367aadd0d0b66fd677ba7675992e07b0b5e5cea6018a3a28cecd90660706","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Four-dimensional three-form algebra) of arXiv:2608.30638, 'On compact steady pluriclosed soliton surfaces'] Let $(V,g)$ be an oriented real four dimensional vector space endowed with a positive definite metric $g$. If $\theta$ is a one-form and
