{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.222656+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d4d7ddc57601ed2a366ff6f203c3f57b917d88d9ef11c78176566a634669f8a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma upmax of arXiv:2412.09471, 'On the moderate deviation principles in the sparse multi-type Erd\H{o}s R\'enyi random gra'] For any scaling sequence $n^{1/4}\ll a_n\ll \sqrt{n}$ and any $\beta\in{\mathbb R}^{d}$, the following conditional superior limit holds:
