{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.766954+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7df369c336f78ecffe1c88c04a65cd19bd00f5064c43f030960fcd253ea96fd0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Assume the notation from Definition \ref{Def.ScaledLPPBot} and let $\hsai$ be as in Proposition \ref{Prop.PHSALE}. 
