{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:19:00.924752+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e4b4da95c96f8484c80bcfc29035e25d12a02f38d4ee13e1dac80ef4455eb32","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 (Finite supercritical exit for $\beta_1=0$) of arXiv:2608.20638, 'Provable Edge-of-Stability for Adam on a One-Dimensional Quadratic'] Let $T\in\Nzero$ and let $\delta>0$ satisfy
