{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.745661+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e4cf8805fc2fbbae2285a510b4208d77a3b35fac815813852850af1b26356b8","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:circle-endpoint-exponent of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] Define
