{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:29:21.915605+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7e9533c197b3158fc0f5929ffdd4f3b9e0ced77de5efa19d4a660bcfae2a5923","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2608.01419, 'A model of opinion dynamics evolving via a preferential attachment mechanism involving mul'] Recall the model described in \S\ref{subsec:model_growing_sample_size}, and assume that 
