{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.518976+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ec87e4ed2215e7298f212c7c3475e2466222208b7bedecc77d67c4bfd186220","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq:full-continuity of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{thm:theta_locality}
