{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.906157+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ef36faee26a246ef98ab3817ea330598947b8e3efb48f84820f1e8e02566695","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:ND-strong of arXiv:2411.11429, 'Functional Central Limit Theorem for topological functionals of Gaussian critical points'] {Let $  \mathcal I$ be any finite set of ordered multi-indices.}
