{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.454977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7ffd50125279bb8b2e0d9ce1df6ec52e472a8fe1bae7f392a4dc59b1c5d9afcc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm box-crossing of arXiv:2605.14910, 'Sharp Phase Transition for the Formation of Infinite Tubes'] Let $1\le k\le d-1$.
