{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.643143+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8003e3980a21c791899f1b0bb3a23562411ec2ccb1abbda0086af25b0b42e833","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 (Energy and Hodge relations) of arXiv:2608.30715, 'Endpoint Energy Atoms Force Local Pressure Concentration in Three-Dimensional Navier--Stok'] For \(\tau<t<T_*\),
\begin{equation}
