{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.226713+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_804f0892b8990fa8b0b8455c50f66e6e26e30bf56aa8c52c7357af72ba868c6f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma basic energy estimate of arXiv:2609.00627, 'Global well-posedness of radially symmetric strong solutions to two-dimensional compressib'] There is a constant $C>0$ depending only on $\gamma$, $\Omega$, $\|\rho_0\|_{L^\infty}$, $\|\boldsymbol{u}_0\|_{L^2}$ and $\|\nabla\boldsymbol{d}_0\|_{L^2}$ such that
