{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.253794+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_808659bb1cbe7e55e5d09059421b681730e09bd38b7308b62bb2dd5fdbe4f34b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 7 ($\BL^{\kappa}$ metric) of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Let $(X,d^X)$ be a metric space and define $\calM(X)_{\mathrm{fin}}$ by
\begin{equation*}
