{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.304141+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_810cb5cdc44a57b2801965f71f9fddb11d64984ee50a79edf86946eba9fff4b1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2608.21905, '\bf Ruin theory incorporating MIPP-type jumps'] Assume $c\ge E[\xi]$, then we have
