	Then the two models have  identical state-wise prospective reserves:
	 $$(V^i)_{i \in \mathcal{Z}}=(\bar V^i)_{i \in \mathcal{Z}}.$$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

