{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.039342+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8235117b9c1d69bb80556979805da7395841f0e429e1e35041c096105e93c839","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2606.31596, 'The Invariant Measure of Multiscale Markov Chains via Fast Arborescence Factorization'] Let $(\mathfrak V,\mathfrak E)$ be a digraph with positive weights $R_N$ and let $(\mathcal Q, \mathcal E)$ be the corresponding DAG of irreducible classes defined above. Then:

