{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.140251+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_826f8992296a8f225e9f330d481ea357d5afda6bd56d9f2959080a8307f966cd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem T:graph main of arXiv:2507.01236, 'Disintegration theorem for multifunctions, \\ with applications to empirical Wasserstein d'] Suppose that~$\mu$ has density~$f$ with respect to uniform probability on~$\mathfrak{X}$ such that
