{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.971126+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82a4fef6ccab598adde0cb4dcfb141e1cbaf63a0d0893deb1f84d8943bfdd231","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:dotG of arXiv:2411.07157, 'Rough differential equations in the flow approach'] For every $N\in\N$, we have
