{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.498373+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82e00b637250fec884aba02bae54a5541d4891ed7f2251202243d016c8b1c169","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 of arXiv:2605.29608, '2605.29608'] We say that $P$ satisfies a log-Sobolev inequality with constant $C_{\text{LS}}$ if
