{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.538539+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_82e77ad62bc80b22b96184cd3db8e129adc213d1986b94859f27433c39d246d7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 2 of arXiv:2608.25829, 'Topology of low-dimensional generalized Ricci solitons and string backgrounds'] Let $(M^6, g, J)$ be a compact non-K\"ahler regular BHE manifold.  Then a finite cover of $M$ is diffeomorphic to $N \times T^k$ where either
