{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.056406+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_831b9cca3aab9fb8e6034b344f9baa69bf3841a5b7e27a67bf5f2d7d2d33a66c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] Let $\gamma = 1/16$. For every $R>0$, there is a constant $C>0$ such that
