{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:27.944712+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8351f07704641d16ae74e6090d00a17a7b8818d2900fed60325090f26cedc518","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 (Weighted weak law of large numbers) of arXiv:2608.24616, '2608.24616'] For each $t$, let $(p_j(t))_{j\geq1}$ be nonnegative random weights,
