{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.759553+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8359cc0efa53cecddcfda7b9837793922f687aeb42f185a7eeb25b980870b75a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm NewLDP of arXiv:2609.02682, 'LDP for tensor forms'] Suppose $\{Q_n\}_{n\ge 1}$ is a sequence of symmetric, zero-diagonal $v$-tensors, such that   \begin{align}\|W_{Q_n}- W_\infty\|_{\square^*}\xrightarrow{n\to\infty}0,
