{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.769426+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_835bfe55614943161a3695a946d3bf786a906db37e645493695cd6ca9349d184","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 7 of arXiv:2608.30445, 'Derivation of a linearly elastic elliptic membrane shell theory in the framework of magnet'] There exist constants $\varepsilon_1>0$ and $C_1>0$ such that
			\[
			\left\{
