{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:28.002844+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8397ffc596250a8391468248567a57651b19ed76f2eb093b65ddaa54ffe2126f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 28 (Canonical/modulated identity) of arXiv:2608.24863, 'Uniform Logarithmic Sobolev Inequalities for the 2D Coulomb Gas at the Diffusive Temperatu'] One has the exact thermal-equilibrium splitting
