where $E[D_1] = \frac{d}{dq} \Big( E[q^{\theta_1} I(e_1 \text{ does not reach } N)] + E[q^{\tau_N} I(e_1 \text{ reaches } N)] \Big) \Big|_{q=1}$, and $S(N;p)$ is the scale function defined in Theorem \ref{thm1}.","status":"unverified"}

