{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:45.380385+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_843aa762acb981eb0e3a4f4377324113238e2bff55b35ede27371c68429e3361","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 25 of arXiv:2607.27535, 'Universal topological statistics on \\ triangulated singular spaces'] The set $k \cdot \ordsimp{d}$ triangulates into FK-simplices as follows:
    \begin{align} 
