{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.496021+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8462f84a4e88fcf42ff6e77dec86f10ac912c7b8c4d33355fb9c69d62e40c6f8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 41 of arXiv:2605.09459, 'Multipoint connectivity in the branching interlacement process'] Let $\mathcal{A} \in \mathbb{A}_{k,n,m}$. For each $\vec{a} = (u,v) \in \mathcal{A}_i$, let
