{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.007523+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_846eac7faca150ce78051086954ef2ad2fd09cc3c22e0eeb273fd1818b5d9357","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma unique of arXiv:2606.27844, 'Critical percolation on preferential attachment graphs with infinite variance'] For all $\varepsilon, \delta>0$ there exists $M_0=M_0(\varepsilon, \delta)$ such that,
