{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.949135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_84ce185851a3d113b0ec04f213c7a9192f3831147cbe6bf5cb1d902e1e3b3fb1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 (Upper bound on resolvent entries) of arXiv:2606.24887, '2606.24887'] Let $\delta \in (0,1)$ and $\Gamma$ be as in \cref{eq:theta}. 
